00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:12.983
First zone fleet staging proceeding on schedule.

00:03:13.192 --> 00:03:15.528
Second zone proceeding
three minutes behind schedule.

00:03:15.736 --> 00:03:17.655
Integrated command network Shen Qi Chen

00:03:17.863 --> 00:03:20.116
switching to Status Fennu in 30 seconds.

00:03:20.324 --> 00:03:23.619
First brigade of Knightmares,
prepare to move out. Repeat...

00:03:23.828 --> 00:03:26.038
Field Marshall Xing-ke, we have received word

00:03:26.247 --> 00:03:29.792
from Captain Minami on the lkaruga
that the detached force is ready to go.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.213
Good. Once our main force
hits Britannia in eastern China,

00:03:34.422 --> 00:03:36.132
we'll head for the shores of Kyushu.

00:03:36.215 --> 00:03:36.382
"Black Knights Main Base - Horai Island”

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:38.634
"Black Knights Main Base - Horai Island” I'll let
you decide what to do about an assistant, Xiang-lin.

00:03:38.634 --> 00:03:38.843
"Black Knights Main Base - Horai Island”

00:03:38.843 --> 00:03:40.094
"Black Knights Main Base - Horai Island”
Zun ming.

00:03:40.094 --> 00:03:40.261
"Black Knights Main Base - Horai Island”

00:03:41.512 --> 00:03:42.138
| came alone, as I promised.
Now, what's the meaning of this, Jeremiah?

00:03:42.138 --> 00:03:46.183
"Area 11 - Atami Bayside" | came alone, as I
promised. Now, what's the meaning of this, Jeremiah?

00:03:46.183 --> 00:03:46.392
"Area 11 - Atami Bayside"

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:47.059
"Area 11 - Atami Bayside" What is it
about Princess Cornelia's whereabouts

00:03:47.059 --> 00:03:48.394
What is it about
Princess Cornelia's whereabouts

00:03:48.602 --> 00:03:51.313
which you can only tell to me?

00:03:51.939 --> 00:03:57.403
"Area 11 - Kyushu Block -
Kagoshima Settlement”

00:04:20.968 --> 00:04:22.803
This is already Britannian territory.

00:04:23.012 --> 00:04:25.181
Don't let a single soldier land here!

00:04:28.225 --> 00:04:30.144
The enemy has fallen for our plan!

00:04:30.352 --> 00:04:32.354
They should be shorthanded toward the south.

00:04:32.563 --> 00:04:33.981
Get our landing forces on the ground!

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:35.816
Enemy forces headed for Yamaguchi!

00:04:36.025 --> 00:04:37.610
Garcia team, wiped out!

00:04:37.818 --> 00:04:40.696
Damn the Black Knights!
How could they have gotten so strong?!

00:04:40.905 --> 00:04:42.865
We thought we could maintain
our absolute territorial defense line,

00:04:43.073 --> 00:04:45.701
but after what Xing-ke did to us
in the Battle of the East China Sea...

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:47.620
Don't panic!

00:04:47.828 --> 00:04:49.747
As long as we can defend Area 11,

00:04:49.955 --> 00:04:53.793
then the imperial armies led
by Prince Odysseus and the others

00:04:54.001 --> 00:04:56.128
will rush into the U.F.N. territory.

00:04:56.337 --> 00:05:00.132
All of the other Knights of the Round
are also deployed on the front line.

00:05:01.675 --> 00:05:04.261
Or, to put it another way,
if Japan is liberated,

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:07.807
then the other Britannian colony areas
will spring into action one after another.

00:05:08.015 --> 00:05:09.975
It will redraw the map of the world!

00:05:10.184 --> 00:05:11.393
In short...

00:05:11.602 --> 00:05:13.145
...this is the decisive battle.

00:05:24.281 --> 00:05:26.200
Deploy Hong Gu's unit into the left wing!

00:05:26.408 --> 00:05:28.494
Prepare for the second charge.

00:05:28.702 --> 00:05:31.497
You are Xing-ke, are you not, sir?

00:05:31.705 --> 00:05:33.541
Rumor has it that you are a child prodigy.

00:05:33.749 --> 00:05:35.251
Knight of One!

00:05:35.459 --> 00:05:37.628
This should be good! I invite you to fight me!

00:05:51.767 --> 00:05:54.061
Behold Excalibur!

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:57.648
The holy sword named by His Majesty himself!

00:06:00.651 --> 00:06:02.319
You came alone?

00:06:02.528 --> 00:06:04.113
| promised I would.

00:06:04.321 --> 00:06:05.906
I'm surprised you made it here.

00:06:06.115 --> 00:06:09.368
There were 31 routes I could take,
depending on the circumstances.

00:06:09.577 --> 00:06:12.162
Especially with Britannia being so loose
with the routes related to the royal family--

00:06:12.371 --> 00:06:14.081
That's not what I meant, Lelouch.

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:17.376
I'm surprised you had the nerve
to show your face in front of me.

00:06:17.585 --> 00:06:19.753
That's what I meant.

00:06:19.753 --> 00:06:20.254
"Kururugi Shrine"
That's what I meant.

00:06:20.254 --> 00:06:20.462
"Kururugi Shrine"

00:06:20.462 --> 00:06:21.881
"Kururugi Shrine"
Because you promised?

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:22.089
"Kururugi Shrine"

00:06:22.089 --> 00:06:24.842
"Kururugi Shrine" | have no reason to
believe any of your promises at this point.

00:06:24.842 --> 00:06:25.050
"Kururugi Shrine"

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:29.263
"Kururugi Shrine" Then why did you
also come here alone? After what you did?

00:06:29.263 --> 00:06:29.471
"Kururugi Shrine"

00:06:29.471 --> 00:06:31.765
"Kururugi Shrine"
Because I'm sick and tired of lying.

00:06:31.765 --> 00:06:32.141
Because I'm sick and tired of lying.

00:06:32.349 --> 00:06:36.770
To Nunnally. About Geass. About Zero.

00:06:36.979 --> 00:06:38.856
Nothing's worse.

00:06:39.064 --> 00:06:43.152
Some friend you were.
You were betraying me all along!

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:47.406
Not just me. Everyone on the
student council, too. And Nunnally.

00:06:47.615 --> 00:06:50.659
E-Even Euphy!

00:06:50.868 --> 00:06:53.579
Why didn't you tell me you were Zero?

00:06:53.787 --> 00:06:57.541
| helped to get you transferred
during your court martial, right?

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:02.630
| was planning to reveal myself
to you back then, if you had joined us.

00:07:02.838 --> 00:07:04.173
But then...

00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:08.677
Are you sure about this, Tohdoh?
Just sitting here?

00:07:08.886 --> 00:07:10.804
We still haven't received word from Zero.

00:07:11.013 --> 00:07:14.141
But now that the Knights of
the Round have joined the battle,

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:15.976
even Field Marshal Xing-ke won't be a match.

00:07:16.185 --> 00:07:17.394
Have faith in Zero.

00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:19.897
| can't! Not after he brought Orange

00:07:20.105 --> 00:07:21.941
and that Rolo guy into
our ranks without any discussion!

00:07:22.149 --> 00:07:24.735
Don't you think he has too
many secrets and acts too arbitrarily?

00:07:24.944 --> 00:07:27.404
Like taking Kinoshita
for that secret mission before!

00:07:27.613 --> 00:07:30.616
We need Zero's abilities now!

00:07:30.824 --> 00:07:33.160
Haven't we discussed this over
and over with Ohgi and the others?

00:07:33.369 --> 00:07:35.537
Then what about once Japan is liberated?

00:07:35.746 --> 00:07:38.457
What happens then?

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.210
| want to know for sure.

00:07:41.418 --> 00:07:43.921
Did you use your Geass on Euphy?

00:07:45.339 --> 00:07:46.256
Yes.

00:07:46.465 --> 00:07:48.926
You made her massacre the Japanese?

00:07:50.469 --> 00:07:51.929
| ordered her to.

00:07:52.137 --> 00:07:56.350
Why would you use your
Geass like that? Answer me!

00:07:56.558 --> 00:07:59.144
To motivate the Japanese.

00:07:59.353 --> 00:08:01.605
If the Specially Administrated Zone
of Nippon had been established,

00:08:01.814 --> 00:08:04.900
the Black Knights would have collapsed.

00:08:05.109 --> 00:08:07.319
That's why you did it?

00:08:07.528 --> 00:08:11.532
All of it was nothing more than
a means to further your ambitions?

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:14.868
That's right. All the sin is mine to bear.

00:08:15.077 --> 00:08:17.246
But Nunnally has nothing to do with it!

00:08:17.454 --> 00:08:20.541
You coward! Using Nunnally like that!

00:08:21.917 --> 00:08:24.628
Suzaku... I'm sorry.

00:08:24.837 --> 00:08:27.423
I've no shame or honor left.

00:08:27.631 --> 00:08:31.218
This is all that I want, Geass be damned!

00:08:31.427 --> 00:08:34.638
Just please, save Nunnally! I beg of you!

00:08:35.931 --> 00:08:39.268
What you've done is inhuman!

00:08:39.476 --> 00:08:42.312
You think this is enough
to get me to forgive you?!

00:08:42.521 --> 00:08:46.233
No, I don't! But this is all I have left!

00:08:46.442 --> 00:08:49.445
You're the only one I can count
on to save Nunnally now!

00:08:49.653 --> 00:08:55.409
You think I... That I'll forgive you?
That everyone will forgive you?!

00:08:55.617 --> 00:08:59.288
The people you've tricked?!
The people who have died?!

00:09:01.248 --> 00:09:06.462
If you want to apologize,
bring Euphy back to life! Right now!

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:10.215
Let's see you save the world
with all your malice! Right now!

00:09:10.424 --> 00:09:13.302
You're Zero, the miracle worker, aren't you?!

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:17.765
I've performed no miracles.
It's all been calculation and stage production.

00:09:17.973 --> 00:09:20.392
The mask they call Zero is a symbol!

00:09:20.601 --> 00:09:22.436
Just a device to let me tell a lie!

00:09:22.644 --> 00:09:26.356
A device? You think that excuse will work?!

00:09:26.565 --> 00:09:29.193
If you're going to tell a lie,
then keep it going till the very end!

00:09:29.401 --> 00:09:34.239
But I can't go back to the past!
| can't undo what's been done!

00:09:34.448 --> 00:09:37.201
Answer me, Lelouch!

00:09:37.409 --> 00:09:41.121
Why did you cast a Geass on me
to make me want to live?!

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:45.834
The Geass you cast which drives me
to live has perverted my convictions.

00:09:46.043 --> 00:09:48.337
Why would you curse me like that?!

00:09:48.545 --> 00:09:51.507
Because I wanted to survive.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:00.099
You're lying, aren't you?

00:10:00.307 --> 00:10:03.811
Lelouch, there's only one way
to redeem yourself for those lies.

00:10:04.019 --> 00:10:06.855
You could make your lies the truth.

00:10:07.064 --> 00:10:07.815
Huh?

00:10:08.023 --> 00:10:11.735
You told the lie that
you were a knight of justice.

00:10:11.944 --> 00:10:15.322
So try and become a true knight of justice.

00:10:15.531 --> 00:10:19.451
Keep the lie going to the very end.

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:21.495
But... How?

00:10:21.703 --> 00:10:25.749
End this war. You're Zero, after all.

00:10:25.958 --> 00:10:29.044
No... This is a job only Zero can do!

00:10:29.253 --> 00:10:33.423
Do it in a way that brings peace to
the world and happiness to everyone.

00:10:33.632 --> 00:10:36.677
Do that, and I'll save Nunnally.

00:10:36.885 --> 00:10:38.637
You'll... You'll save her?

00:10:38.846 --> 00:10:44.810
For Nunnally's sake,
once more, we'll work together.

00:10:45.018 --> 00:10:47.020
Thank you.

00:10:47.229 --> 00:10:50.482
The two of us together...
can accomplish anything!

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:52.734
What the...?!

00:10:52.943 --> 00:10:54.069
Hold it right there, Zero!

00:10:54.278 --> 00:10:56.613
We already know your real identity!

00:10:56.822 --> 00:10:58.198
Wha--?!

00:10:58.407 --> 00:10:59.783
Are you all right, Sir Suzaku?!

00:10:59.992 --> 00:11:01.660
--Please step back!
--Suzaku...

00:11:01.869 --> 00:11:03.745
You set me up from the start?!

00:11:03.954 --> 00:11:05.122
Wait, please!

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:08.792
You've done a great deed, Sir Suzaku.

00:11:09.001 --> 00:11:10.878
Now this war is over.

00:11:11.086 --> 00:11:16.216
| see... You planned to sell me out again!

00:11:16.425 --> 00:11:21.763
You betrayed me, Suzaku... You betrayed me!

00:11:22.681 --> 00:11:27.102
Who'd have thought the ace of the
Black Knights went to a Britannian school?

00:11:27.311 --> 00:11:28.979
You found this in the student council room?

00:11:29.188 --> 00:11:32.524
Yeah. It was hidden deep in a locker,
like it was something very precious.

00:11:32.733 --> 00:11:36.195
There are ones missing here
and there, though. Ones of you, too.

00:11:36.403 --> 00:11:38.822
Well, I suppose he couldn't leave too many

00:11:39.031 --> 00:11:41.909
showing him palling around with a terrorist!

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.039
That's right. He...

00:11:47.247 --> 00:11:49.374
He can look like that too, huh?

00:11:49.583 --> 00:11:52.794
I've never seen Suzaku smile like that.

00:11:53.003 --> 00:11:54.463
Uh-huh...

00:11:55.214 --> 00:11:56.006
Look...

00:11:56.215 --> 00:11:56.798
What?

00:11:57.007 --> 00:12:01.053
You're a Britannian-Eleven half-breed, right?

00:12:01.261 --> 00:12:04.348
If you chose the name
Stadtfeld instead of Kozuki,

00:12:04.556 --> 00:12:05.974
you could have a good life, right?

00:12:06.183 --> 00:12:08.685
Even become one of the
Knights of the Round, if you wanted.

00:12:08.894 --> 00:12:10.145
What are you getting at?

00:12:10.354 --> 00:12:14.608
I'm just saying, wouldn't you
like to come back to our side?

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:19.613
| can't believe Zero's identity is a student!

00:12:22.658 --> 00:12:24.576
How sad.

00:12:24.785 --> 00:12:26.453
Zero, the killer of royalty.

00:12:26.662 --> 00:12:31.333
How tragic that he would turn out
to be my own younger brother.

00:12:31.541 --> 00:12:32.584
Brother!

00:12:32.793 --> 00:12:37.214
However, Lelouch, I'm willing to
intervene with His Majesty on your behalf.

00:12:37.422 --> 00:12:39.883
Your life may yet be spared.

00:12:40.092 --> 00:12:42.594
You think you can show me pity?!

00:12:44.263 --> 00:12:45.389
Y-You mean...!

00:12:45.597 --> 00:12:48.809
Yes. This was all done under
orders from Prince Schneizel.

00:12:49.017 --> 00:12:52.646
He figured that following
you would lead us to Zero in the end.

00:12:52.854 --> 00:12:56.358
His Highness realized there was
something between you and Zero,

00:12:56.566 --> 00:12:58.860
as well as Geass and Code-R.

00:13:02.114 --> 00:13:06.618
| won't bring any harm upon you.
Can't you believe this of me?

00:13:06.827 --> 00:13:07.619
Believe you?

00:13:07.828 --> 00:13:09.830
That's right. Trust your brother.

00:13:10.038 --> 00:13:14.668
Unfortunately, brother,
I'm through trusting anything.

00:13:14.876 --> 00:13:16.962
Because friendship only betrays me.

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:22.175
Sir Gilbert...

00:13:22.384 --> 00:13:24.428
Who are you?! You're not Orange!

00:13:24.636 --> 00:13:27.931
Wait, please. I just have
a request to ask of you.

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:35.689
| see. What should I do for you?

00:13:35.897 --> 00:13:38.483
Oh, it's simple, really.

00:13:38.692 --> 00:13:40.861
If I assume this pose,

00:13:41.069 --> 00:13:46.033
from that moment on, you will
recognize me as Cornelia. And then...

00:13:46.241 --> 00:13:49.077
P-Princess Cornelia!

00:13:49.286 --> 00:13:52.289
Guilford, my knight! Save me!

00:13:52.497 --> 00:13:54.583
Yes, Your Highness!

00:13:55.751 --> 00:13:58.503
About time you realized it, Guilford!

00:13:58.712 --> 00:14:00.464
Sir Gilbert, what are you doing?!

00:14:00.672 --> 00:14:04.760
Have you gone mad?
Capturing your own liege lord?!

00:14:04.968 --> 00:14:08.096
So, this is the power of Geass...

00:14:08.305 --> 00:14:10.432
Princess, we need to withdraw for now!

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:11.892
Lelouch!

00:14:14.394 --> 00:14:16.188
Lelouch!

00:14:17.773 --> 00:14:21.193
"Tokyo Settlement"

00:14:21.193 --> 00:14:21.777
"Tokyo Settlement"
So then, the No. 7 loop plan?

00:14:21.777 --> 00:14:23.862
So then, the No. 7 loop plan?

00:14:24.071 --> 00:14:27.616
Yes. Tell Tohdoh to switch places with you.

00:14:27.824 --> 00:14:30.744
The amount of time we have to
take back Nunnally and Kallen is limited.

00:14:30.952 --> 00:14:31.953
I'm counting on you, Rolo.

00:14:32.162 --> 00:14:34.998
Mm-hmm. Leave it to me, big brother.

00:14:35.207 --> 00:14:39.252
Letting me come back to the Tokyo
Settlement as a student was a mistake.

00:14:39.461 --> 00:14:41.588
| had plenty of time to prepare.

00:14:48.637 --> 00:14:49.388
What?

00:14:49.596 --> 00:14:50.806
My... My energy filler!

00:14:51.014 --> 00:14:53.100
A Gefjun Disturber?!

00:14:59.981 --> 00:15:02.943
Message to Black Knight Ikaruga fleet!

00:15:03.151 --> 00:15:07.280
The Gefjun Disturbers have immobilized
all utilities, communications,

00:15:07.489 --> 00:15:11.451
and pre-fifth generation Knightmares
in the Tokyo Settlement!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.328
The enemy's military might has been halved!

00:15:13.537 --> 00:15:17.791
Hit all major facilities and take away
the settlement's ability to keep fighting us!

00:15:17.999 --> 00:15:19.042
We have to accomplish this

00:15:19.251 --> 00:15:21.753
before the main forces
under Schneizel's command arrive.

00:15:21.962 --> 00:15:25.173
Once we establish a defense line,
we'll cut off the government bureau!

00:15:25.382 --> 00:15:28.927
If we can arrest Viceroy Nunnally,
then victory will be ours!

00:15:29.136 --> 00:15:32.848
Viceroy Nunnally, it's Zero! Zero has appeared!

00:15:33.056 --> 00:15:34.015
Zero!

00:15:34.224 --> 00:15:35.434
Zero's come?!

00:15:35.642 --> 00:15:37.269
That's a better look on your face.

00:15:37.477 --> 00:15:40.397
That looks more like the real you.

00:15:40.605 --> 00:15:43.775
But I'm sorry. Your wish won't come true.
y

00:15:43.984 --> 00:15:46.945
Not as long as I and my Tristan are here.

00:15:48.155 --> 00:15:51.199
F.L.E.I.J.A.? Equipped on the Lancelot?

00:15:51.408 --> 00:15:54.411
We need power if we're going
to capture the escaped Zero, right?

00:15:54.619 --> 00:15:58.290
But I've heard that the F.L.E.I.J.A.
was a tactical-level weapon.

00:15:58.498 --> 00:16:02.335
Suzaku, you were Princess
Euphemia's knight, weren't you?

00:16:02.544 --> 00:16:05.297
Will you not fight now? Against Lelouch?

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.636
Tohdoh! You, Asahina, and Chiba

00:16:11.845 --> 00:16:13.555
will establish air supremacy
over the government bureau!

00:16:13.763 --> 00:16:15.474
Wilco!

00:16:15.682 --> 00:16:17.142
Now then, the problem remaining

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:20.604
is the enemy 6th generation
and above Knightmares. Rolo!

00:16:20.812 --> 00:16:23.273
How is your infiltration proceeding?

00:16:23.482 --> 00:16:28.111
Sayoko's team is going on ahead.
We'll be rendezvousing with her shortly.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:31.031
Good. Be sure you take Nunnally alive.

00:16:32.949 --> 00:16:34.493
Lelouch...

00:16:34.701 --> 00:16:37.829
Do you hear me, Zero? Cease this battle at once!

00:16:38.038 --> 00:16:40.707
This unit is equipped with
a high-yield tactical warhead.

00:16:40.916 --> 00:16:44.294
If I use it, it will inflict over
40 million liters of damage!

00:16:44.503 --> 00:16:45.045
Before I do that--!

00:16:45.253 --> 00:16:49.466
As if I'd believe anything
you have to say! Jeremiah!

00:16:49.674 --> 00:16:51.510
It can't be! Sir Jeremiah?!

00:16:51.718 --> 00:16:56.431
Suzaku Kururugi, where did you go astray?
Now you will receive...

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.058
...my discipline!

00:17:00.143 --> 00:17:02.270
No avail!

00:17:02.479 --> 00:17:05.232
Experience all-encircling loyalty!

00:17:06.566 --> 00:17:07.943
Even you, a Pureblood...

00:17:08.151 --> 00:17:09.277
...joined with Zero?!

00:17:12.405 --> 00:17:14.699
The Sutherland Sieg seems to be effective.

00:17:14.908 --> 00:17:16.117
Although...

00:17:16.326 --> 00:17:16.868
Huh?

00:17:17.077 --> 00:17:19.996
We'll never be able
to mass-produce a one-off unit

00:17:20.205 --> 00:17:22.791
that uses the Siegfried's systems.

00:17:22.999 --> 00:17:27.712
What I'm more interested in is someone
telling me why he's on our side now--

00:17:27.921 --> 00:17:30.882
The man they called
the Spearhead of the Empire.

00:17:31.091 --> 00:17:35.804
What's going on? Why...
Why am I fighting Britannian forces?

00:17:36.012 --> 00:17:37.847
Guilford!

00:17:38.056 --> 00:17:40.976
Assist Jeremiah and shoot Suzaku Kururugi!

00:17:41.184 --> 00:17:43.019
But Princess, Kururugi is...!

00:17:43.228 --> 00:17:46.147
There's no time to explain! It's an emergency!

00:17:46.356 --> 00:17:48.567
Can't you trust me and just fight?

00:17:50.735 --> 00:17:53.530
If you're going to drag civilians into this,
I'll show no mercy!

00:17:54.781 --> 00:17:55.907
Sir Gilbert?

00:17:56.116 --> 00:17:58.493
Kururugi! We each serve our lords!

00:17:58.702 --> 00:17:59.661
It's nothing personal!

00:17:59.869 --> 00:18:01.830
Suzaku! Fire F.L.E.I.J.A.!

00:18:02.038 --> 00:18:03.748
Use this chance to kill Zero!

00:18:03.957 --> 00:18:08.169
I'm sorry, Nina. I won't use this. However...!

00:18:08.378 --> 00:18:10.463
| swear... I will stop Zero!

00:18:17.846 --> 00:18:22.809
Excellent. We will finish Suzaku now,
then go and take Nunnally back.

00:18:26.062 --> 00:18:28.982
There is nothing which can defeat
a Knight of the Round on the battlefield!

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:31.776
Gino! Thank you!

00:18:31.985 --> 00:18:34.279
You should sound happier about it.

00:18:35.989 --> 00:18:38.116
All this military strength...
Damn you, Schneizel!

00:18:38.325 --> 00:18:40.577
Did he anticipate my showdown in Tokyo?!

00:18:44.914 --> 00:18:48.543
Right. I'll be rendezvousing
with you a little later than expected.

00:18:48.752 --> 00:18:54.341
Okay, understood. We've just cleared
up to the 13th floor now.

00:18:54.549 --> 00:18:58.011
Don't worry. I promise, I'll find Nunnally.

00:18:58.219 --> 00:19:01.056
Right. I'm counting on you, Rolo.

00:19:01.264 --> 00:19:05.727
If you can just take back Nunnally,
I'll have no further need for you, Rolo.

00:19:05.935 --> 00:19:10.315
Don't worry, big brother.
| promise, I'll find Nunnally

00:19:10.523 --> 00:19:12.359
because I'm going to kill her.

00:19:12.567 --> 00:19:14.944
I'm the only family you need to have.

00:19:15.153 --> 00:19:16.780
Master Rolo!

00:19:16.988 --> 00:19:20.408
Emergency report from group two
headed towards the hangars.

00:19:20.617 --> 00:19:23.119
They say they've sighted priority item three.

00:19:27.457 --> 00:19:28.708
About Lelouch...

00:19:28.917 --> 00:19:29.501
Huh?

00:19:29.709 --> 00:19:31.961
Where do you suppose he could be right now?

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:33.254
Who knows?

00:19:33.463 --> 00:19:36.424
Shirley, have you been in touch with him lately?

00:19:36.633 --> 00:19:38.134
Mm-mm.

00:19:47.727 --> 00:19:49.145
I'm begging you, Zero!

00:19:49.354 --> 00:19:51.856
Once more!
Let's at least discuss this once more!

00:19:52.065 --> 00:19:55.860
Hmph, there's no point.
No matter what a traitor like you may say...

00:19:56.069 --> 00:19:58.947
Hmm? Why, you!

00:19:59.155 --> 00:20:00.031
Anya?

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:00.949
Wait!

00:20:01.157 --> 00:20:04.494
Suzaku! Leave Zero to Anya!

00:20:04.703 --> 00:20:09.874
Which is stronger?
Your shield or my Stark Hadron cannon?

00:20:10.083 --> 00:20:11.626
Wh-What the hell?!

00:20:11.835 --> 00:20:13.962
Even my Absolute Defense Field
can't withstand this for long!

00:20:15.714 --> 00:20:17.048
Contact lost with the Shinkiro!

00:20:17.257 --> 00:20:19.634
He seems to be engaging the Knight of Six!

00:20:19.843 --> 00:20:21.594
What are your orders for Nakagawa unit?

00:20:21.803 --> 00:20:23.513
We also have to defend Kujuukuri.

00:20:23.722 --> 00:20:25.265
Um... That is...

00:20:25.473 --> 00:20:27.308
Patch Nakagawa through to me!

00:20:27.517 --> 00:20:30.228
Sugiyama, do we have anyone
we can send to help Zero?!

00:20:30.437 --> 00:20:33.606
Relief units? At a time like this?

00:20:33.815 --> 00:20:36.985
Right. Viceroy Nunnally is in the escape craft.

00:20:37.193 --> 00:20:40.697
But until the Gefjun
Disturbers are deactivated...

00:20:42.657 --> 00:20:46.244
Right. We'd be a target for the enemy
if we escaped in a Knightmare.

00:20:46.453 --> 00:20:48.371
Right. Understood.

00:20:51.124 --> 00:20:52.292
Sayoko!

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:56.921
You're looking well.
Master Rolo is going to get Miss Nunnally.

00:20:57.130 --> 00:21:00.258
We came to give you a present, Miss Kallen.

00:21:01.676 --> 00:21:05.472
| think Miss Milly's former
fiancé was behind the changes,

00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:09.184
but there seems to be
a draft user's manual with it.

00:21:09.392 --> 00:21:11.019
Shall we try to get it working?

00:21:11.227 --> 00:21:13.354
It's different, somehow...

00:21:16.441 --> 00:21:20.487
We can't stretch our lines any further!
We're at the breaking point now!

00:21:21.905 --> 00:21:25.200
All Gefjun Disturbers in lkebukuro
and Sugamo have been destroyed.

00:21:25.408 --> 00:21:28.995
Now we can reinforce our lines with
5th generation Knightmares and older.

00:21:29.204 --> 00:21:31.831
We're also bringing the government
bureau's defense system back on line.

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:34.501
The momentum of battle has shifted in our favor.

00:21:38.922 --> 00:21:39.547
The lights!

00:21:39.756 --> 00:21:40.757
We're out of time!

00:21:40.965 --> 00:21:43.384
Kinoshita! Haven't you found the viceroy yet?!

00:21:43.593 --> 00:21:46.346
The assault teams have only reported
that they've freed Captain Kozuki...

00:21:46.554 --> 00:21:47.764
Kinoshita!

00:21:52.143 --> 00:21:55.104
Sugiyama, you idiot! There's nobody here!

00:21:55.313 --> 00:21:58.608
Where's Zero? He's my best pal!

00:22:00.401 --> 00:22:02.320
A little more, and...

00:22:06.074 --> 00:22:07.742
Something is...

00:22:09.744 --> 00:22:11.162
What happened to the Mordred?

00:22:14.624 --> 00:22:15.625
Zero!

00:22:15.834 --> 00:22:19.754
It's not smart for the commander
to go off on his own.

00:22:19.963 --> 00:22:22.632
Another Knight of the Round!

00:22:22.841 --> 00:22:24.968
Which is why you will lose...

00:22:25.176 --> 00:22:28.471
...something that is most
precious to you, namely...

00:22:28.680 --> 00:22:30.306
...your life!

00:22:35.937 --> 00:22:37.856
So, the basic system is the same?

00:22:43.069 --> 00:22:45.446
We're still trying to determine
Master Zero's current location.

00:22:45.655 --> 00:22:47.949
Shall I transfer the I.F.F. data?

00:22:48.157 --> 00:22:49.826
Yes, please.

00:22:55.665 --> 00:23:00.920
Let's see... How about
Guren S.E.L.T.E.N. Eight...?

00:23:02.171 --> 00:23:03.089
Confirm activation.

00:23:03.298 --> 00:23:05.008
Activation, confirmed.

00:23:05.216 --> 00:23:08.887
Once the Guren is launched,
we'll return to our own mission.

00:23:09.095 --> 00:23:12.181
Right. You take care
of the viceroy. I'll help Zero.

00:23:12.390 --> 00:23:14.392
Right. Well, then...

00:23:14.601 --> 00:23:15.059
Guren!

00:23:15.268 --> 00:23:18.271
S.E.L.T.E.N. Eight Elements... Launch!

00:23:18.479 --> 00:23:19.772
Launch!

00:23:26.946 --> 00:23:29.574
What the...?! What's...?!

00:23:29.782 --> 00:23:32.869
F-Father... Forgive me!

00:23:34.037 --> 00:23:35.163
David!

00:23:37.206 --> 00:23:40.460
Was that Kozuki? But, that machine she's in...!

00:23:44.213 --> 00:23:45.423
At this rate...!

00:23:45.632 --> 00:23:46.925
At this point,

00:23:47.133 --> 00:23:50.053
the battle will be decided by
who has the most energy left.

00:23:50.261 --> 00:23:52.263
Abraham squadron,
don't let him go, no matter what!

00:23:52.472 --> 00:23:54.307
Yes, my lord!

00:23:54.515 --> 00:23:55.975
Zero! Do you read me, Zero?!

00:23:56.184 --> 00:23:57.477
Where are my reinforcements?!

00:23:57.685 --> 00:23:58.895
Tamaki will be there soon!

00:23:59.103 --> 00:24:00.939
But we've sighted an enemy
silhouette over the Pacific!

00:24:01.147 --> 00:24:02.065
What about it?!

00:24:02.273 --> 00:24:04.734
Zero, it's me!
The enemy silhouette seems to be

00:24:04.943 --> 00:24:06.903
the Britannian emperor's flagship!

00:24:07.111 --> 00:24:08.363
What?!

00:24:08.571 --> 00:24:10.657
He's coming to Area 11 as well?!

00:24:13.660 --> 00:24:16.704
No. His Majesty is not
coming to the battlefield.

00:24:16.913 --> 00:24:18.706
Why are you so sure?

00:24:18.915 --> 00:24:23.211
Do you think he cares about
mundane things? About this one day?

00:24:23.419 --> 00:24:25.505
Not him...

00:24:25.713 --> 00:24:27.382
Let Zero go!

00:24:27.590 --> 00:24:32.136
You're messing with his
best pal, Shinichiro Tamalki...

00:24:32.345 --> 00:24:35.390
Dammit! Why does this always happen to me?!

00:24:35.598 --> 00:24:38.017
Right! Now's my chance!

00:24:38.226 --> 00:24:42.563
Just what I was waiting for, Zero!
The moment of your attack!

00:24:42.772 --> 00:24:46.567
Now, to blow what you value most to atoms!

00:24:47.944 --> 00:24:49.570
Wh-What the...?

00:24:49.779 --> 00:24:51.322
Nunnally!

00:24:55.284 --> 00:24:57.120
We've been outfoxed! When did...?!

00:24:57.328 --> 00:25:00.206
An Eleven, besting me, a Pureblood?!

00:25:06.462 --> 00:25:07.505
Ah...

00:25:07.714 --> 00:25:09.465
K-Kallen?

00:25:09.674 --> 00:25:12.385
Zero! Kallen Kozuki,
captain of your personal guard

00:25:12.593 --> 00:25:14.804
has now returned to the front line!

00:25:15.013 --> 00:25:17.432
Thieves! That's mine! It's mine!

00:25:17.640 --> 00:25:20.560
Not quite, sir. I improved it too, remember?

00:25:20.768 --> 00:25:22.854
Uh, right. Like you said.

00:25:23.062 --> 00:25:24.564
No, that's not what I mean!

00:25:24.772 --> 00:25:27.483
If the pilot is a Devicer
who could handle that machine,

00:25:27.692 --> 00:25:29.694
even at 60% output, it would be...!

00:25:29.902 --> 00:25:34.157
That's the Earl of Pudding's work!
And Cécile's energy wings, too!

00:25:34.365 --> 00:25:36.492
How dare they do that to
my Guren without permission!

00:25:36.701 --> 00:25:39.620
Still, now that we've got Kallen back...

00:25:39.829 --> 00:25:41.998
We're at our full fighting strength!

00:25:53.342 --> 00:25:54.677
Whoa!

00:26:00.266 --> 00:26:01.684
Eleven!

00:26:01.893 --> 00:26:04.228
Do you know the truth of the battlefield?

00:26:04.437 --> 00:26:07.023
Kill a man normally,
and it's considered a crime,

00:26:07.231 --> 00:26:10.234
but on the battlefield, the more
you kill, the greater a hero you are.

00:26:10.443 --> 00:26:14.655
Huh. So, Mr. Vampire of Britannia
wants to be a hero, is that it?

00:26:14.864 --> 00:26:17.742
No. I'm saying I like to openly take lives,

00:26:17.950 --> 00:26:21.287
the thing which people value the most!

00:26:21.496 --> 00:26:22.455
You know...

00:26:22.663 --> 00:26:24.749
...you're not much of a gentleman!

00:26:28.377 --> 00:26:29.253
And now...

00:26:29.462 --> 00:26:32.173
Yeah, so what?

00:26:32.381 --> 00:26:33.257
That won't work with me!

00:26:33.466 --> 00:26:36.094
But now I've drawn you in close!

00:26:38.554 --> 00:26:40.890
Wh-What?!

00:26:41.099 --> 00:26:44.143
Question: What do you value the most?

00:26:44.352 --> 00:26:45.686
Is it just your own life?

00:26:45.895 --> 00:26:47.730
You think an Eleven can threaten me?!

00:26:47.939 --> 00:26:49.607
Goodbye.

00:26:52.193 --> 00:26:58.533
My life! My life has been taken?!
B-By a monkey like you?!

00:27:00.076 --> 00:27:00.868
Good work, Kallen!

00:27:01.077 --> 00:27:03.371
Now get back to the government
bureau and get Nunnally!

00:27:03.579 --> 00:27:04.914
Zero!

00:27:05.123 --> 00:27:06.124
Suzaku Kururugi!

00:27:06.332 --> 00:27:07.625
Whoops!

00:27:08.709 --> 00:27:09.919
Kallen! Stand aside!

00:27:10.128 --> 00:27:12.046
| will not, Suzaku!

00:27:13.381 --> 00:27:17.343
Kallen! So, you chose the name
Kozuki over Stadtfeld in the end.

00:27:17.552 --> 00:27:19.137
That's right.

00:27:19.345 --> 00:27:20.638
Suzaku!

00:27:20.847 --> 00:27:22.890
Leave Kallen for me to settle things with!

00:27:23.099 --> 00:27:25.518
The problem with that, Suzaku...

00:27:25.726 --> 00:27:27.478
I'm sorry, Gino.

00:27:27.687 --> 00:27:30.565
She's not the sort of opponent
you should play around with.

00:27:30.773 --> 00:27:33.526
Tohdoh's forces have broken through
to the enemy's headquarters!

00:27:35.570 --> 00:27:39.782
Impossible! My Gareth!

00:27:39.991 --> 00:27:41.868
Raise shields in area four!

00:27:42.076 --> 00:27:44.078
We're just after Schneizel's head!

00:27:44.287 --> 00:27:46.289
Assume Slash and Encircle formation!

00:27:51.335 --> 00:27:54.672
Explosion detected in section 4-I of the ship!

00:27:55.715 --> 00:27:59.051
No... Could it be Chigusa?

00:28:00.720 --> 00:28:02.388
Don't you have any weaknesses anywhere?!

00:28:02.597 --> 00:28:06.559
Suzaku! Kallen isn't the one
you should be fighting! It's Zero!

00:28:18.321 --> 00:28:20.323
Master Zero, we've found the viceroy!

00:28:20.531 --> 00:28:22.074
| see! Good work!

00:28:22.283 --> 00:28:26.537
Master Rolo said he'll escort us
out of here after he secures a Knightmare.

00:28:26.746 --> 00:28:29.707
Understood! Now, all the conditions
for victory are in place.

00:28:29.916 --> 00:28:31.626
Kallen! Finish off Suzaku now!

00:28:31.834 --> 00:28:33.419
Do that and nothing will stand in our way!

00:28:33.628 --> 00:28:34.212
Yes, sir!

00:28:34.420 --> 00:28:35.588
Get out of there, Sir Suzaku!

00:28:35.796 --> 00:28:37.131
The Lancelot's no match as it is!

00:28:37.340 --> 00:28:38.216
But, Zero is...!

00:28:38.424 --> 00:28:39.217
Oh, you!

00:28:39.425 --> 00:28:41.135
You stubborn fool!

00:28:43.429 --> 00:28:45.223
It's... It's too great...

00:28:45.431 --> 00:28:47.475
The difference in machine potential!

00:28:53.940 --> 00:28:57.735
Highness, at this rate, we're going
to lose Sir Suzaku along with Sir Luciano!

00:28:57.944 --> 00:29:00.112
Shoot it, Suzaku!
The F.L.E.I.J.A. can beat them!

00:29:00.321 --> 00:29:04.408
No! In the end, this is just a threat!
If we actually use it, then...!

00:29:07.870 --> 00:29:10.456
I-I can't win...

00:29:10.665 --> 00:29:12.917
Goodbye, Suzaku.

00:29:13.125 --> 00:29:14.502
Kill Suzaku now!

00:29:14.710 --> 00:29:17.546
Fire the F.L.E.I.J.A.! You'll save yourself!

00:29:17.755 --> 00:29:20.591
But if I do that...!

00:29:20.800 --> 00:29:23.261
Even if it costs me my life here...!

00:29:23.469 --> 00:29:26.764
That's right... This is redemption.

00:29:26.973 --> 00:29:30.059
| have no choice but to accept it. Now...

00:29:30.268 --> 00:29:31.727
I'm going to!

00:29:33.646 --> 00:29:36.065
I... have to live!

00:29:50.705 --> 00:29:52.581
Is this... F.L.E.I.J.A.?

00:29:52.790 --> 00:29:56.002
Fall back! All units, retreat!

00:29:56.210 --> 00:30:00.172
Something's wrong!
Pull the lkaruga back, maximum speed!

00:30:00.381 --> 00:30:01.590
We have to retreat, too!

00:30:01.799 --> 00:30:05.636
Asahina, storming the
government bureau is on hold!

00:30:05.845 --> 00:30:09.557
You in the Sutherland, what are you doing?!
They've fired the F.L.E.1.J.A.!

00:30:09.765 --> 00:30:10.891
F.L.E.LLJ.A.?

00:30:11.100 --> 00:30:14.395
Could that be the weapon
Suzaku mentioned before?

00:30:14.603 --> 00:30:16.689
Nunnally!

00:30:22.987 --> 00:30:25.406
Senba, Urabe, and me...!

00:30:25.614 --> 00:30:28.242
Why did they use the F.L.E.I.J.A. here?!

00:30:32.913 --> 00:30:34.874
Princess, save yourself!

00:30:35.082 --> 00:30:37.752
Princess!

00:30:51.640 --> 00:30:54.143
We've confirmed a gigantic explosion
has occurred in the Tokyo Settlement.

00:30:54.352 --> 00:30:57.104
From the reports, we believe
it was a F.L.E.I.J.A. warhead.

00:30:57.313 --> 00:30:58.731
Are you sure about this, Your Majesty?

00:30:58.939 --> 00:31:00.816
Should we be staying here at Kamine Island?

00:31:01.025 --> 00:31:04.987
Enough! Let Schneizel handle it all.

00:31:05.196 --> 00:31:06.739
At least ten million of the general populace

00:31:06.947 --> 00:31:09.533
are believed dead from the initial damage.

00:31:09.742 --> 00:31:13.412
Secondary damages will
result in 25 million casualties.

00:31:13.621 --> 00:31:15.414
Since all rescue facilities were annihilated,

00:31:15.623 --> 00:31:17.833
we have no way of rescuing any civilians.

00:31:18.042 --> 00:31:20.920
The Tokyo Settlement has died.

00:31:21.128 --> 00:31:24.924
No... How could this have happened?!

00:31:25.132 --> 00:31:28.469
They're all... They're all...!

00:31:30.429 --> 00:31:33.015
...did this?!

00:31:33.224 --> 00:31:35.017
The fugitive's on the portside runway, right?

00:31:35.226 --> 00:31:37.686
Wait, please! We need to
get our forces reorganized first!

00:31:37.895 --> 00:31:39.939
Understood! I'll be back there in a minute!

00:31:40.147 --> 00:31:41.732
Ohgi!

00:31:44.026 --> 00:31:45.611
Chigusa.

00:31:47.154 --> 00:31:50.408
Hold it right there, Miss Fugitive.

00:31:52.701 --> 00:31:56.831
Cornelia?! I thought it was
Villetta who had escaped.

00:31:57.039 --> 00:31:58.082
It's been a long time.

00:31:58.290 --> 00:32:00.084
The television man without a shred of honor...

00:32:00.292 --> 00:32:06.674
Is Zero behind this? He should
have shown a little more trust in me!

00:32:06.882 --> 00:32:10.010
Aim for her legs! I want her taken alive!

00:32:11.470 --> 00:32:13.931
We are carrying a Britannian
special diplomatic envoy!

00:32:14.140 --> 00:32:16.934
| repeat, we are carrying a
Britannian special diplomatic envoy!

00:32:17.143 --> 00:32:19.728
We have no intention of attacking!

00:32:19.937 --> 00:32:21.188
A special envoy?

00:32:21.397 --> 00:32:25.067
Minase, was there a request to negotiate?

00:32:30.322 --> 00:32:31.157
Brother!

00:32:31.365 --> 00:32:36.120
Impossible! Schneizel
has come aboard personally?

00:32:36.203 --> 00:32:36.370
"Kyushu Block - Kagoshima Settlement”

00:32:36.370 --> 00:32:38.873
"Kyushu Block - Kagoshima Settlement” What's
the meaning of this temporary cease-fire?

00:32:38.873 --> 00:32:39.081
"Kyushu Block - Kagoshima Settlement”

00:32:39.081 --> 00:32:40.249
"Kyushu Block - Kagoshima Settlement”
What are the Britannians up to?!

00:32:40.249 --> 00:32:40.458
"Kyushu Block - Kagoshima Settlement”

00:32:40.458 --> 00:32:40.958
"Kyushu Block - Kagoshima Settlement”
Why did Bismarck withdraw his troops?!

00:32:40.958 --> 00:32:42.251
Why did Bismarck withdraw his troops?!

00:32:42.460 --> 00:32:45.504
We're still confirming that,
but they don't seem to want to attack us.

00:32:45.713 --> 00:32:48.966
There seems to be a
cease-fire in Tokyo, as well.

00:32:49.175 --> 00:32:51.385
Did Zero order it?

00:32:51.594 --> 00:32:53.012
Master?!

00:32:53.220 --> 00:32:55.389
Hang in there, big brother.

00:32:55.598 --> 00:32:56.348
Where's Nunnally?

00:32:56.557 --> 00:32:59.059
I'm here for you, big brother.

00:32:59.268 --> 00:33:02.605
We've been doing fine up till now
with just the two of us, haven't we?

00:33:05.733 --> 00:33:09.528
Jeremiah? I'd like big brother
to be left alone for now.

00:33:09.737 --> 00:33:12.990
You can talk to him later.

00:33:13.199 --> 00:33:13.782
Huh?

00:33:13.991 --> 00:33:17.912
Right. It may not mean
much of anything. Mm-hmm.

00:33:18.120 --> 00:33:20.706
Big brother has me here with him, after all.

00:33:20.915 --> 00:33:23.083
What are you doing with this?!

00:33:23.292 --> 00:33:23.751
Huh?

00:33:23.959 --> 00:33:28.339
| wanted to give this to Nunnally! To Nunnally!

00:33:28.547 --> 00:33:33.052
You think you can replace Nunnally
in my heart?! You damned imposter!

00:33:35.179 --> 00:33:40.643
<i>Haven't you figured it out yet?
| hate you. I despise you!</i>

00:33:40.851 --> 00:33:44.688
I've tried over and over to kill you,
but I just haven't succeeded!

00:33:44.897 --> 00:33:45.314
Big brother?

00:33:45.523 --> 00:33:48.776
Get out of here! I never want to see you again!

00:33:48.984 --> 00:33:51.070
You imposter!

00:33:53.030 --> 00:33:57.243
In the end, I just didn't understand

00:33:57.451 --> 00:33:59.537
just how great the damage would be...

00:33:59.745 --> 00:34:02.706
Nina, you need to make a choice.

00:34:02.915 --> 00:34:04.875
Do you abandon science to preserve your heart

00:34:05.084 --> 00:34:08.587
or destroy your heart and
sacrifice yourself to science?

00:34:08.796 --> 00:34:10.923
How can I make that choice?

00:34:11.131 --> 00:34:13.425
Did you make that choice too, Prof. Lloyd?

00:34:13.634 --> 00:34:16.262
My heart was destroyed from the very start.

00:34:16.470 --> 00:34:19.431
I'm self-aware enough to acknowledge that.

00:34:19.640 --> 00:34:22.560
| was the one who built the F.L.E.I.J.A...

00:34:22.768 --> 00:34:25.563
| killed them...

00:34:25.771 --> 00:34:28.816
All of them! All of them!

00:34:34.738 --> 00:34:36.657
It's no use. Zero won't answer.

00:34:36.865 --> 00:34:40.828
We've no choice, then. We'll have
to meet with Schneizel without Zero.

00:34:41.036 --> 00:34:45.916
But Zero's our leader, isn't he?
Won't it be wrong to proceed on our own?

00:34:46.125 --> 00:34:47.167
Diethard!

00:34:47.376 --> 00:34:49.712
Why didn't you take
Schneizel captive immediately?

00:34:49.920 --> 00:34:51.589
He only had one
Knightmare guarding him, right?

00:34:51.797 --> 00:34:52.798
We could have avenged Asahina...

00:34:53.007 --> 00:34:56.051
His plane is equipped
with a F.L.E.I.J.A. warhead.

00:34:56.260 --> 00:34:57.261
F.L.E.LLJ.A.?

00:34:57.469 --> 00:35:00.556
The bomb which caused that gigantic explosion.

00:35:00.764 --> 00:35:05.269
If it had exploded there,
neither we nor Zero would have survived.

00:35:05.477 --> 00:35:08.022
We don't know what
Schneizel's objective here is.

00:35:08.230 --> 00:35:10.983
Our only option right now is to talk to him.

00:35:11.191 --> 00:35:14.987
I'll pass. I'd like to check over
my Guren now that it's back.

00:35:15.195 --> 00:35:17.948
Then the negotiators will
be myself, Chiba, Diethard,

00:35:18.157 --> 00:35:21.702
--and if Ohgi is around...
--Forget it. I can't find Ohgi anywhere.

00:35:21.910 --> 00:35:25.289
Jeez! Where'd that guy go?

00:35:25.497 --> 00:35:25.998
Kallen!

00:35:26.206 --> 00:35:28.042
Thank goodness, you're back in one piece!

00:35:28.250 --> 00:35:30.794
Sorry to worry you all.

00:35:31.003 --> 00:35:32.254
Hey, where's Zero?

00:35:32.463 --> 00:35:33.547
| heard he's in his quarters.

00:35:33.756 --> 00:35:36.091
There's talk he's been wounded.

00:35:37.051 --> 00:35:41.305
| once tried to use you
to seize power for myself.

00:35:41.513 --> 00:35:45.768
That was untoward of me.
I'm terribly sorry. But still...

00:35:45.976 --> 00:35:48.937
You and I share an odd connection, don't we?

00:35:49.146 --> 00:35:52.775
Under normal circumstances,
we should have joined forces.

00:35:52.983 --> 00:35:57.863
I'll take my leave now, sir.
| must search for Lady Nunnally.

00:36:02.576 --> 00:36:05.788
Nunnally is...

00:36:05.996 --> 00:36:08.707
Survivors will please register
their names in order...

00:36:21.970 --> 00:36:22.763
Milly!

00:36:22.971 --> 00:36:24.807
You're alive, aren't you?!

00:36:25.015 --> 00:36:28.435
Yeah. I'm alive. I'm alive!

00:36:30.729 --> 00:36:32.564
Where is Zero?

00:36:32.773 --> 00:36:34.483
Zero isn't coming.

00:36:34.692 --> 00:36:37.569
Not until we determine the details
of what you wish to discuss.

00:36:37.778 --> 00:36:40.572
No, I wouldn't have expected him to show up.

00:36:40.781 --> 00:36:41.323
Hmm?

00:36:41.532 --> 00:36:44.326
In a situation like this,
he keeps things to himself

00:36:44.535 --> 00:36:46.036
and holds people at a distance.

00:36:46.245 --> 00:36:50.165
You talk as if you know Zero intimately.

00:36:50.374 --> 00:36:52.334
More than you people do.

00:36:52.543 --> 00:36:56.171
Zero is my and Cornelia's younger brother.

00:36:56.380 --> 00:36:58.173
--Huh?
--Say what?!

00:36:58.382 --> 00:37:03.846
The former 11th prince of the Holy
Britannian Empire: Lelouch vi Britannia.

00:37:04.054 --> 00:37:06.765
The man I both loved and feared the most.

00:37:06.974 --> 00:37:07.891
Impossible!

00:37:08.100 --> 00:37:10.602
You're ea yin' Zero's a Britannian prince?!
y

00:37:10.811 --> 00:37:14.857
Diethard, didn't you ever realize?

00:37:15.065 --> 00:37:19.319
You received information
from various involved parties, right?

00:37:19.528 --> 00:37:20.946
You're wasting your time.

00:37:21.155 --> 00:37:24.867
You can't cause chaos here
by spreading these absurd stories.

00:37:25.075 --> 00:37:27.035
It's not Zero's lineage we acknowledge,

00:37:27.244 --> 00:37:30.289
but rather the miracles he's performed for us.

00:37:30.497 --> 00:37:33.667
But what if those miracles were just shams?

00:37:33.876 --> 00:37:34.710
Shams?

00:37:34.918 --> 00:37:38.088
Zero has a power given to him from Code-R,

00:37:38.297 --> 00:37:42.968
or a woman who goes by the
name C.C., which is called Geass.

00:37:43.177 --> 00:37:45.971
The power to force anyone to obey his orders.

00:37:46.180 --> 00:37:48.891
You could think of it as
extremely powerful hypnosis.

00:37:49.099 --> 00:37:51.018
And you're saying his
miracles come from that power?

00:37:51.226 --> 00:37:53.645
Don't you talk crap about my man Zero!

00:37:53.854 --> 00:37:57.065
He's got brains and guts,
and he's just awesome!

00:37:57.274 --> 00:37:58.817
All this talk about princes and Geass!

00:37:59.026 --> 00:38:01.945
Where's your proof, huh? You got proof, huh?

00:38:02.154 --> 00:38:03.655
I've got your proof.

00:38:03.864 --> 00:38:05.240
O-Ohgi?

00:38:05.449 --> 00:38:06.492
And Villetta?

00:38:06.700 --> 00:38:08.494
What he says is all true.

00:38:08.702 --> 00:38:11.663
Zero's true identity is the
former Britannian prince Lelouch,

00:38:11.872 --> 00:38:14.792
who possesses the power of Geass.

00:38:21.965 --> 00:38:24.718
Master, please take off your clothes.

00:38:26.011 --> 00:38:26.595
What?

00:38:26.804 --> 00:38:31.183
Do you hurt anywhere?
If it's some place you can't reach, I can...

00:38:33.685 --> 00:38:37.606
That's right... It's some place I can't reach.

00:38:39.274 --> 00:38:42.569
Zero, may I come in?

00:38:42.778 --> 00:38:44.655
Kallen?

00:38:46.740 --> 00:38:49.243
Ohgi said he wanted you
to come to storeroom four.

00:38:49.451 --> 00:38:50.285
Why?

00:38:50.494 --> 00:38:52.120
Sorry, but I didn't ask why he wanted you.

00:38:52.329 --> 00:38:53.580
Master?

00:38:55.415 --> 00:38:58.919
Please take off your clothes.
I'll do my best, I promise.

00:38:59.127 --> 00:39:02.005
Huh? Wh-What the hell
have you two been up to?!

00:39:02.214 --> 00:39:03.590
While I've been rotting in a cell, you've...!

00:39:03.799 --> 00:39:07.219
N-No, you've got it wrong. C.C. is now... Um...

00:39:08.512 --> 00:39:10.305
She's lost her memory.

00:39:10.514 --> 00:39:11.473
Huh?

00:39:11.682 --> 00:39:17.521
It's my fault.
So, the C.C. you knew is gone now.

00:39:29.533 --> 00:39:31.034
Kallen...

00:39:31.243 --> 00:39:35.414
It's good you made it back.
I'm sorry it took so long to send help.

00:39:35.622 --> 00:39:42.254
Lelouch, I happened to talk to Nunnally.
She was concerned about me.

00:39:42.462 --> 00:39:43.255
| see.

00:39:43.463 --> 00:39:46.383
Look... I know it's
no comfort at a time like this,

00:39:46.592 --> 00:39:48.135
but when I lost my brother--

00:39:51.763 --> 00:39:53.849
There's something we'd like to confirm, Zero.

00:39:54.057 --> 00:39:55.434
Are you Lelouch?

00:39:55.642 --> 00:39:58.937
Have you been using Geass to deceive us?

00:40:00.814 --> 00:40:05.110
The legendary hero Zero died in
battle before realizing his ambitions.

00:40:05.319 --> 00:40:10.032
But his gallant life will live on in legend!

00:40:10.240 --> 00:40:12.868
Is that the script you've
written for me, Diethard?

00:40:13.076 --> 00:40:17.998
To be honest, I wanted to film
your triumph against Britannia,

00:40:18.206 --> 00:40:21.710
but I'm afraid that show has been cancelled.

00:40:21.919 --> 00:40:25.172
What do I do? It looks like they don't
know the conditions for using my Geass.

00:40:25.380 --> 00:40:27.215
| didn't want to do this, but at this point...

00:40:27.424 --> 00:40:29.009
Everyone trusted you!

00:40:29.217 --> 00:40:32.137
What did Inoue and Yoshida die for?!

00:40:32.346 --> 00:40:33.180
Wait a minute!

00:40:33.388 --> 00:40:35.223
This is way too one-sided!

00:40:35.432 --> 00:40:38.477
Look how far we've been able
to come because of Zero!

00:40:38.685 --> 00:40:40.103
Step aside, Kallen!

00:40:40.312 --> 00:40:43.106
Don't tell me he used his Geass on you, too!

00:40:46.109 --> 00:40:51.323
Answer me, Lelouch. What am I to you?

00:40:51.531 --> 00:40:55.577
If I could stay with you, I would... Please.

00:40:58.205 --> 00:41:01.500
| see. This is you calling "check” on me.

00:41:01.708 --> 00:41:04.795
Then there must not be
any way out of this for me.

00:41:05.003 --> 00:41:07.130
Please, just answer me!

00:41:09.466 --> 00:41:15.973
Fools! You finally figured it out!
That I've been using you all.

00:41:16.181 --> 00:41:18.684
That you're nothing but pawns to me!

00:41:18.892 --> 00:41:23.814
Zero! It isn't like you to
turn on us! Tell us the truth!

00:41:24.022 --> 00:41:25.983
Zero!

00:41:26.191 --> 00:41:28.193
Lelouch...

00:41:28.402 --> 00:41:32.656
Kallen, you were the most
special piece of all for me to play.

00:41:32.864 --> 00:41:35.242
That's right. This was all just
a board for me to play on.

00:41:35.450 --> 00:41:37.828
Just a game to me.

00:41:38.036 --> 00:41:39.621
| see...

00:41:42.082 --> 00:41:44.501
Goodbye then, Lelouch.

00:41:46.878 --> 00:41:48.255
Take aim!

00:41:48.463 --> 00:41:50.549
Just a minute, please!
We haven't heard him out yet!

00:41:50.757 --> 00:41:54.302
What good will it do to give him
enough time to use his Geass?

00:41:56.179 --> 00:41:58.724
Zero, say something!

00:42:00.767 --> 00:42:03.186
Kallen... You have to live.

00:42:04.104 --> 00:42:05.689
Fire!

00:42:08.233 --> 00:42:09.484
Are you okay, big brother?!

00:42:09.693 --> 00:42:12.779
--Rolo?!
--Big brother, I'll protect you!

00:42:16.033 --> 00:42:19.036
Stop it, Rolo! That's enough!

00:42:19.244 --> 00:42:20.912
Master...

00:42:21.121 --> 00:42:22.914
Anya, Zero's escaped.

00:42:23.123 --> 00:42:25.208
Can you capture him with the Mordred?

00:42:26.501 --> 00:42:28.712
If I can destroy him...

00:42:33.842 --> 00:42:38.430
| never realized how difficult it was
to calculate the Absolute Defense Field.

00:42:38.638 --> 00:42:40.599
My big brother really is incredible, isn't he?

00:42:40.807 --> 00:42:44.019
Rolo! I have no reason to live any longer!

00:42:48.273 --> 00:42:49.399
Huh?

00:42:49.608 --> 00:42:51.151
How can it move like that?

00:42:51.359 --> 00:42:54.529
| won't let them kill you! I swear!

00:42:55.906 --> 00:42:57.449
Using your Geass over such a large area...

00:42:57.657 --> 00:43:01.286
Stop! Your heart won't
be able to take the strain!

00:43:01.495 --> 00:43:04.122
Attention, all units!
The Shinkiro has been stolen!

00:43:04.331 --> 00:43:08.960
Any units capable of combat,
destroy the Shinkiro! I repeat...

00:43:12.839 --> 00:43:16.301
Enough, Rolo! I don't have
any reason to live anymore!

00:43:16.510 --> 00:43:18.720
| won't, big brother. Because...

00:43:18.929 --> 00:43:20.055
Stop...

00:43:27.938 --> 00:43:31.108
...doing this, Rolo! Why are you trying to...

00:43:35.153 --> 00:43:37.405
...save me?! I...

00:43:39.699 --> 00:43:47.290
Yeah... Maybe you've just
been using me all this time...

00:43:47.499 --> 00:43:48.959
...was only...

00:43:57.592 --> 00:43:59.052
...using you!

00:43:59.261 --> 00:44:00.554
Rolo!

00:44:03.598 --> 00:44:04.266
But...

00:44:04.474 --> 00:44:08.979
Stop it! Don't use your Geass!
Do you want to die?!

00:44:09.187 --> 00:44:15.652
You're... the only one... who really
saw me, big brother... which is why...

00:44:15.861 --> 00:44:19.823
...for my own sake... I have to save you...!

00:44:27.664 --> 00:44:32.752
Rolo, why did you save me?
After all I've done to you?

00:44:32.961 --> 00:44:36.089
Because you're a liar, big brother.

00:44:36.298 --> 00:44:37.465
Huh?

00:44:37.674 --> 00:44:43.138
It was a lie, wasn't it?
About trying to kill me...

00:44:43.346 --> 00:44:46.141
About... hating me...

00:44:46.349 --> 00:44:50.395
Yeah. You saw right through it, didn't you?

00:44:50.604 --> 00:44:52.480
Just what I'd expect of my little brother.

00:44:52.689 --> 00:44:56.276
Yeah... That's right... Because... I know...

00:44:56.484 --> 00:45:00.447
...everything about you... big brother...

00:45:03.074 --> 00:45:06.578
Yeah. You did.

00:45:06.786 --> 00:45:10.498
Your big brother... is nothing but a liar.

00:45:13.960 --> 00:45:17.214
According to the materials left behind
by Director V.V. and our brethren,

00:45:17.422 --> 00:45:19.090
this point is optimal.

00:45:19.299 --> 00:45:22.344
It will synchronize with the rest of the
ruins scattered throughout the world.

00:45:22.552 --> 00:45:26.473
With this, we can make the
Sword of Akasha usable once again.

00:45:26.681 --> 00:45:32.729
Heh, to think that I could use
such an ancient device.

00:45:32.938 --> 00:45:36.149
Yes, we have the Britannians
assisting us as well!

00:45:36.358 --> 00:45:39.736
As soon as you confirm its location,
alert all forces and destroy the Shinkiro!

00:45:39.945 --> 00:45:42.989
--Yes, sir!
--What about my master?

00:45:47.077 --> 00:45:48.828
It's been ages since
we were face to face like this!

00:45:49.037 --> 00:45:51.748
<i>T's me! t's me!</i>

00:45:51.957 --> 00:45:54.292
C.C., don't tell me you've...

00:45:54.501 --> 00:45:56.544
No! Forgive me!

00:46:14.562 --> 00:46:18.441
What are you doing,
closing yourself up in here again?

00:46:18.650 --> 00:46:21.403
C.C.2C.C.

00:46:21.611 --> 00:46:23.738
Hmm? Who are you?

00:46:23.947 --> 00:46:25.991
It's me. See?

00:46:26.199 --> 00:46:29.744
You...! So, you've chased
me all the way in here, now?

00:46:29.953 --> 00:46:32.664
Are you that worried about Lelouch, Marianne?

00:46:32.872 --> 00:46:37.377
Oh, please! Do you really think
I'm that ideal a mother?

00:46:37.585 --> 00:46:39.254
Then why did you come here?

00:46:39.462 --> 00:46:43.258
Because I wanted to know
if you're still on my side.

00:46:43.466 --> 00:46:43.883
Huh?

00:46:44.092 --> 00:46:48.513
C.C., why did you seal off your own Code?

00:46:48.722 --> 00:46:53.768
Even when Charles would
have granted your wish to die.

00:46:53.977 --> 00:46:58.982
That's a good question.
| was a little bit surprised, myself.

00:46:59.190 --> 00:47:02.652
Anyway, let's go back to the real world.

00:47:02.861 --> 00:47:05.238
I've decided, and that's all there is to it.

00:47:05.447 --> 00:47:07.115
How typical of you.

00:47:07.324 --> 00:47:07.699
What is?

00:47:07.907 --> 00:47:11.286
The way you always come in
and mess around with me.

00:47:11.494 --> 00:47:13.830
Yes, because I appreciate what you did.

00:47:14.039 --> 00:47:16.624
At least as far as giving me my Geass.

00:47:16.833 --> 00:47:18.752
Says the woman
who never fulfilled her contract.

00:47:18.960 --> 00:47:21.338
If you think that, shall you come with me?

00:47:21.546 --> 00:47:24.883
Right, but hold on a moment.
There's something I need to take.

00:47:25.925 --> 00:47:28.970
I'm having Anya remain
here aboard the lkaruga.

00:47:29.179 --> 00:47:32.265
We'll need someone here
to take custody of Zero.

00:47:32.474 --> 00:47:38.229
And now, what do you plan to do?
Stay with the Black Knights?

00:47:38.438 --> 00:47:41.858
Neither my brother nor
myself plan to punish you here.

00:47:42.067 --> 00:47:45.653
No, now that the situation
has advanced to the next level,

00:47:45.862 --> 00:47:47.989
there's no way we can act against you now.

00:47:48.198 --> 00:47:50.158
Well... I...

00:47:51.493 --> 00:47:53.036
I'm probably the last person
who should say this,

00:47:53.244 --> 00:47:56.664
but noble rank isn't everything in this world.

00:47:56.873 --> 00:48:00.877
We have no choice. Let's announce
that Zero was killed in battle.

00:48:01.086 --> 00:48:03.088
Even though we haven't found Lelouch yet?

00:48:03.296 --> 00:48:05.590
You want people to think that he's dead?

00:48:05.799 --> 00:48:10.303
Excuse me. I understand that
Zero has had his problems and all that,

00:48:10.512 --> 00:48:12.430
but will you tell people about
that Geass power of his, too?

00:48:12.639 --> 00:48:16.226
That would just get us thrown out
as a bunch of madmen!

00:48:16.434 --> 00:48:17.394
There's no way we can!

00:48:17.602 --> 00:48:19.312
And what if the real Zero appears later?

00:48:19.521 --> 00:48:21.731
How exactly would he prove that?

00:48:23.358 --> 00:48:25.777
In the end, a masked hero is merely a symbol.

00:48:25.985 --> 00:48:28.655
If no one acknowledges him,
he will never establish himself.

00:48:29.989 --> 00:48:33.868
Really? That's great news! Really.

00:48:34.077 --> 00:48:37.580
Yeah! They finally got
the cell phones working again,

00:48:37.789 --> 00:48:39.833
and we found out everyone was okay!

00:48:40.041 --> 00:48:45.296
Oh, yeah. Your room was destroyed,
but there's room in the clubhouse.

00:48:45.505 --> 00:48:46.089
| see.

00:48:46.297 --> 00:48:49.509
Hey, by the way, how's Rolo?
He's with you, right?

00:48:49.717 --> 00:48:52.846
Y-Yeah...

00:48:53.054 --> 00:48:54.180
Rivalz...

00:48:54.389 --> 00:48:56.141
Can you tell the others something for me?

00:48:56.349 --> 00:49:01.104
That I won't be able to keep my promise
to shoot off fireworks with you all.

00:49:01.312 --> 00:49:03.398
What was that supposed to mean?

00:49:13.783 --> 00:49:16.411
Your Majesty, we've completed
preparations for synchronization.

00:49:16.619 --> 00:49:18.621
Very well. Let us begin, then.

00:49:21.833 --> 00:49:24.377
All relic systems are now synchronized.

00:49:24.586 --> 00:49:28.047
With this shall end
the world of the existing God.

00:49:28.256 --> 00:49:30.467
Destruction and creation...

00:49:30.675 --> 00:49:33.344
Ragnarok begins!

00:49:33.553 --> 00:49:35.805
Your Majesty, I have a
communication from Prince Schneizel

00:49:36.014 --> 00:49:36.681
in the Tokyo Settlement...

00:49:36.890 --> 00:49:40.018
Did I not tell you to leave
these mundane affairs to him?

00:49:40.226 --> 00:49:41.728
Mundane?

00:49:41.936 --> 00:49:46.191
Damn you, Schneizel.
Has the truth begun to dawn on you?

00:49:46.399 --> 00:49:51.571
Even so, it's too late!
This game called war is already obsolete.

00:49:54.532 --> 00:49:58.411
This is KTTV. As we've lost our studios,

00:49:58.620 --> 00:50:01.206
we've set up a temporary one
at Ashford Academy

00:50:01.414 --> 00:50:03.500
to bring you this emergency news flash.

00:50:03.708 --> 00:50:06.085
A short while ago, we received official word

00:50:06.294 --> 00:50:10.048
that Prince Schneizel has signed
a cease-fire with the Black Knights.

00:50:10.256 --> 00:50:12.258
In addition, it's been announced
by the Black Knights

00:50:12.467 --> 00:50:16.262
that their CEO, Zero, is dead.

00:50:16.471 --> 00:50:17.096
Zero was wounded in the
battle for the Tokyo Settlement

00:50:17.096 --> 00:50:19.349
"Kyushu Block - Kagoshima Settlement” Zero was
wounded in the battle for the Tokyo Settlement

00:50:19.349 --> 00:50:19.557
"Kyushu Block - Kagoshima Settlement”

00:50:19.557 --> 00:50:22.143
"Kyushu Block - Kagoshima Settlement”
and was treated aboard the flagship lkaruga,

00:50:22.143 --> 00:50:22.185
and was treated aboard the flagship lkaruga,

00:50:22.393 --> 00:50:26.022
but succumbed to
his injuries early this morning.

00:50:34.822 --> 00:50:37.700
| heard from Chigusa
what you did behind our backs!

00:50:37.909 --> 00:50:41.496
If you're going to stay here, you'd better
be prepared for the consequences.

00:50:43.581 --> 00:50:47.043
Um, word is that Suzaku has left.

00:50:47.252 --> 00:50:50.964
We know. He's just too serious.

00:50:51.172 --> 00:50:53.174
He's a lot like you, Mr. Lloyd.

00:50:53.383 --> 00:50:55.385
Ha-ha, you think so?

00:51:04.060 --> 00:51:07.188
Was this Schneizel's idea?

00:51:07.397 --> 00:51:08.898
It's my decision.

00:51:09.107 --> 00:51:13.111
Majesty, I appreciate
the patronage you provided me.

00:51:13.319 --> 00:51:16.614
But you have abandoned
your responsibilities as king.

00:51:16.823 --> 00:51:19.742
If peace could be brought
about through Prince Clovis

00:51:19.951 --> 00:51:23.204
by my doing away with you...

00:51:23.413 --> 00:51:25.582
Why did you stain your hands with Geass?

00:51:25.790 --> 00:51:28.793
Is that a crime?

00:51:29.002 --> 00:51:32.171
Geass brings out the evil nature in people.

00:51:32.380 --> 00:51:37.343
Yes. If you knew about everything,
then you could have saved Euphy.

00:51:37.552 --> 00:51:38.469
But you abandoned her!

00:51:38.678 --> 00:51:41.431
So what?

00:51:41.639 --> 00:51:46.352
Into this sword, I put the despair
you drove Lelouch and Nunnally to!

00:51:46.561 --> 00:51:48.438
Prepare to die!

00:51:48.646 --> 00:51:50.231
S-Sir Bismarck!

00:51:50.440 --> 00:51:53.443
So you've bared your fangs, Knight of Seven?

00:51:53.651 --> 00:51:56.362
A pity, traitorous knight!

00:51:56.571 --> 00:51:59.407
Bismarck, I leave this mundane matter to you.

00:51:59.616 --> 00:52:01.492
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:52:01.701 --> 00:52:02.869
Wait!

00:52:07.582 --> 00:52:10.710
Ohgi? This is Hong Gu.
Requesting landing clearance.

00:52:10.918 --> 00:52:13.254
We've brought Her Majesty
and Lady Kaguya with us.

00:52:13.463 --> 00:52:17.175
R-Right. Then I'll contact
Schneizel's people as well,

00:52:17.383 --> 00:52:18.760
so hold on a moment.

00:52:18.968 --> 00:52:22.805
Um, Minase, open a channel to Britannia.

00:52:25.850 --> 00:52:29.103
Uh-oh. The Geass spell that compels me to live.

00:52:29.312 --> 00:52:31.022
It's screaming at me to run away!

00:52:31.230 --> 00:52:34.275
Is the Knight of One really
that dangerous an opponent?!

00:52:34.484 --> 00:52:36.694
Even so, I've left my weakness behind!

00:52:36.903 --> 00:52:37.779
Fool!

00:52:37.987 --> 00:52:40.031
Your weakness...

00:52:40.990 --> 00:52:44.118
...is what supported the strength
you possessed, which was gentleness!

00:52:44.327 --> 00:52:48.456
That's right. Strength without
a standard to follow is merely violence.

00:52:48.665 --> 00:52:50.500
Which means...

00:52:50.708 --> 00:52:53.878
You should die here, Suzaku Kururugi!

00:53:03.554 --> 00:53:06.349
My name is Lelouch vi Britannia!

00:53:06.557 --> 00:53:08.643
Eldest son of Empress Marianne!

00:53:08.851 --> 00:53:12.480
The prince who was abandoned by his empire!

00:53:12.689 --> 00:53:15.316
Wh-What the hell?!
Why are you shooting at us?!

00:53:15.525 --> 00:53:16.901
Why are we shooting at our own people?!

00:53:17.110 --> 00:53:20.530
We're still verifying it,
but we can't contact gun turret room 3.

00:53:20.738 --> 00:53:22.907
It's possible someone's taken it over!

00:53:23.116 --> 00:53:27.745
Respond, turret room 3! If you do
not respond, we'll remove you by force!

00:53:29.372 --> 00:53:32.542
Follow us in the royal guard!
Destroy all enemies!

00:53:32.750 --> 00:53:34.711
Yes, my lord!

00:53:36.671 --> 00:53:40.133
All the reinforcements from
the Shikine Island base are attacking us!

00:53:40.341 --> 00:53:42.844
We're getting reports of people
in our own ranks turning on us as well!

00:53:43.052 --> 00:53:44.345
This is...

00:53:44.554 --> 00:53:45.596
A rebellion?!

00:53:45.805 --> 00:53:47.515
Yes, my lord! Where is His Majesty?

00:53:47.724 --> 00:53:51.477
His Majesty is in the safest place
he could be. For now, we...

00:53:53.104 --> 00:53:56.399
Lelouch! There's no need for you
to take any more sins upon you!

00:54:00.862 --> 00:54:03.156
Who has command aboard
the Great Britannia?!

00:54:03.364 --> 00:54:06.242
Lady Monica Krushevsky, the Knight of Twelve.

00:54:06.451 --> 00:54:10.496
Very well! Then I'll go out in the Galahad!

00:54:10.705 --> 00:54:12.999
You still can't contact the Mordred?

00:54:13.207 --> 00:54:16.085
No, my lord, although I think
she's headed for Kamine Island.

00:54:16.294 --> 00:54:21.549
Meaning she just received that
intelligence and is going to His Majesty?

00:54:22.800 --> 00:54:25.303
Where do Anya's loyalties lie?

00:54:25.511 --> 00:54:30.391
My apologies, Lady Kaguya.
We have to get to Kamine Island at once.

00:54:30.600 --> 00:54:33.519
Then we shall go with you, as well.

00:54:33.728 --> 00:54:34.729
There's only one person I can think of

00:54:34.937 --> 00:54:40.109
who would be attacking the
Britannian emperor in this situation.

00:54:40.318 --> 00:54:41.819
| agree.

00:54:42.028 --> 00:54:45.573
Which means we have a few points to verify.

00:54:45.782 --> 00:54:49.118
We can continue this
meeting once this matter is settled.

00:54:51.621 --> 00:54:55.249
There's a good chance that the rebels
are under the influence of Geass...

00:54:57.293 --> 00:54:58.127
Anya!

00:54:58.336 --> 00:54:59.587
Surely you aren't part of this, too!

00:54:59.796 --> 00:55:02.548
So, the Knight of One
is behind this coup d'état?!

00:55:02.757 --> 00:55:04.425
What?!

00:55:09.680 --> 00:55:10.681
Don't jump to conclusions!

00:55:10.890 --> 00:55:14.310
How can I trust you? Where's your proof?

00:55:14.519 --> 00:55:16.312
The enemy is from Shikine Island!

00:55:16.521 --> 00:55:18.314
Monica can testify to it!

00:55:18.523 --> 00:55:20.900
Understood. Forgive me.

00:55:21.108 --> 00:55:24.487
All I ask is for you to understand that.
How damaged are you?

00:55:24.695 --> 00:55:26.739
My air combat mobility is dropping.

00:55:26.948 --> 00:55:29.700
| was thinking I could intercept
the rebel forces on the ground.

00:55:29.909 --> 00:55:33.454
Understood. I'll defend the royal flagship.

00:55:34.539 --> 00:55:36.082
Quite the actress, aren't you?

00:55:36.290 --> 00:55:39.293
We don't have time
to explain things to Bismarck.

00:55:39.502 --> 00:55:42.880
If you start off suspecting someone,
it keeps them from mistrusting you, right?

00:55:54.058 --> 00:55:57.061
Now then, God!

00:55:57.270 --> 00:55:59.689
The time has come to settle this!

00:55:59.897 --> 00:56:01.357
Wrong.

00:56:02.608 --> 00:56:05.820
You're mistaken, Charles zi Britannia.

00:56:06.028 --> 00:56:08.698
It's not God you need to settle things with.

00:56:10.825 --> 00:56:12.451
It's with me!

00:56:12.660 --> 00:56:17.874
And how do you plan to do that?
Now that I have the same status as C.C.,

00:56:18.082 --> 00:56:22.628
| cannot die!

00:56:22.837 --> 00:56:29.135
I'm thankful. By coming in here,
you've ensured my victory.

00:56:35.641 --> 00:56:37.518
You've sealed the exit?!

00:56:37.727 --> 00:56:41.439
Yes. I believe this space
might possibly be located

00:56:41.647 --> 00:56:43.274
in the domain of imaginary numbers.

00:56:43.482 --> 00:56:46.444
I've sealed us both up inside this space.

00:56:46.652 --> 00:56:49.280
If you cannot interfere with the real world,

00:56:49.488 --> 00:56:51.157
you may as well be dead!

00:56:51.365 --> 00:56:53.284
Lelouch...

00:56:53.492 --> 00:56:55.661
This system you've made

00:56:55.870 --> 00:56:59.540
has become a prison which
now holds your own soul captive!

00:56:59.749 --> 00:57:05.087
Now, let us repent!
Suffering together for all eternity!

00:57:11.636 --> 00:57:14.639
You woke up too soon.

00:57:14.847 --> 00:57:16.599
C.C.!

00:57:16.807 --> 00:57:20.144
What are you doing here?

00:57:20.353 --> 00:57:21.020
Anya...

00:57:21.228 --> 00:57:24.899
At the moment, I'm Marianne.
Lelouch and Nunnally's mother.

00:57:25.107 --> 00:57:26.400
Huh?

00:57:26.609 --> 00:57:29.612
Now then, since we have plenty of time...

00:57:29.820 --> 00:57:33.240
Will you answer me?
Who was it that killed Mother?

00:57:33.449 --> 00:57:35.618
Why didn't you protect her?

00:57:35.826 --> 00:57:40.998
How strange. You seek the truth from someone.

00:57:41.207 --> 00:57:44.877
You, who has only made it this far by lying.

00:57:45.086 --> 00:57:48.547
That's true. I've been lying all along.

00:57:48.756 --> 00:57:50.424
Not just my name and personal history.

00:57:50.633 --> 00:57:52.969
I've hidden every aspect of my true intentions.

00:57:53.177 --> 00:57:56.222
But I could say the same about you.

00:57:56.430 --> 00:57:59.725
Neither of us can take a step now
without our respective personas.

00:57:59.934 --> 00:58:01.936
You're wrong.

00:58:04.105 --> 00:58:08.526
When it is understood that lies
are meaningless in the face of eternity,

00:58:08.734 --> 00:58:12.321
personas will vanish.
When we understand each other,

00:58:12.530 --> 00:58:15.992
conflict will disappear.

00:58:16.200 --> 00:58:19.328
That is my Ragnarok Connection.

00:58:19.537 --> 00:58:25.668
The world will discard these masks
called deceit, revealing the truth.

00:58:25.876 --> 00:58:27.503
Cs' World?

00:58:27.712 --> 00:58:30.715
To use existing terminology,
it's the collective unconscious.

00:58:30.923 --> 00:58:33.175
A collective of people's minds with memories.

00:58:33.384 --> 00:58:36.053
The sea of transmigration.
The great consciousness.

00:58:36.262 --> 00:58:38.639
Some people refer to it as God.

00:58:38.848 --> 00:58:40.850
Was that what I saw when we met at Narita?

00:58:41.058 --> 00:58:45.187
Forget it. It's too wrecked for me to do.
C.C., could you please?

00:58:45.396 --> 00:58:46.856
You're really going in?

00:58:47.064 --> 00:58:50.901
Of course! Charles is waiting for us, after all.

00:58:51.110 --> 00:58:55.781
It would have been so easy
if you'd given your Code to him.

00:58:55.990 --> 00:58:59.285
Oh... I'll go first.

00:59:06.042 --> 00:59:07.752
What are you doing?!

00:59:11.922 --> 00:59:16.177
Suzaku Kururugi... We're similar, you and I.

00:59:16.385 --> 00:59:17.261
Similar?

00:59:17.470 --> 00:59:20.765
In the way we both wish to die, and yet cannot.

00:59:23.350 --> 00:59:26.479
Prince Schneizel... and the Black Knights?!

00:59:26.687 --> 00:59:28.397
Stay alive, Lelouch!

00:59:28.606 --> 00:59:32.109
There's something I still need to ask you!

00:59:32.318 --> 00:59:34.653
It... It can't be!

00:59:34.862 --> 00:59:37.156
You've grown so much, Lelouch!

00:59:37.364 --> 00:59:38.949
M-Mother?!

00:59:39.158 --> 00:59:41.452
So, you've come, Marianne.

00:59:41.660 --> 00:59:43.829
Is this another illusion?! You'd do this?!

00:59:44.038 --> 00:59:46.624
No. It's really me.

00:59:46.832 --> 00:59:50.920
Although I can only take
my original appearance in this system.

00:59:51.128 --> 00:59:51.921
Really you?

00:59:52.129 --> 00:59:56.550
Lelouch, I'll answer
your previous question now.

00:59:57.843 --> 01:00:02.890
Half a century ago,
my elder brother and I were in hell.

01:00:03.099 --> 01:00:06.602
Our relatives were all
rivals competing for the throne.

01:00:06.811 --> 01:00:08.771
Assassinations became a daily occurrence.

01:00:08.979 --> 01:00:11.524
Day after day of betrayals spawned by lies.

01:00:11.732 --> 01:00:14.068
All of them were dying.

01:00:14.276 --> 01:00:17.822
Even my mother fell victim to it.

01:00:18.030 --> 01:00:21.575
My brother and I were saddened
and angered by the world.

01:00:21.784 --> 01:00:24.662
And so we swore an oath.

01:00:24.870 --> 01:00:28.457
To create a world without lies.

01:00:28.666 --> 01:00:31.919
Both C.C. and I agreed to that pledge.

01:00:32.128 --> 01:00:33.129
V.V., however...

01:00:33.129 --> 01:00:33.629
"Eight years earlier"
V.V., however...

01:00:33.629 --> 01:00:34.672
"Eight years earlier"

01:00:34.672 --> 01:00:36.257
"Eight years earlier"
So, why the urgent call?

01:00:36.257 --> 01:00:36.632
So, why the urgent call?

01:00:36.841 --> 01:00:40.719
I've cleared everyone out of here.
I've even had Cornelia withdraw.

01:00:40.928 --> 01:00:43.472
Sorry to do this without Charles around.

01:00:43.681 --> 01:00:45.558
Is this about the Sword of Akasha?

01:00:45.766 --> 01:00:49.103
Hm? Oh, no. It's about Charles.

01:00:49.311 --> 01:00:52.648
Charles has changed ever since he met you.

01:00:52.857 --> 01:00:56.902
It's as if you both enjoy learning
more and more about each other.

01:00:57.111 --> 01:01:01.198
If this goes on, the contract
we made will never be fulfilled.

01:01:01.407 --> 01:01:03.409
I'll be left alone.

01:01:03.617 --> 01:01:08.956
Since the days of myth, it's always
the woman who leads the man astray.

01:01:09.165 --> 01:01:10.040
Lady Marianne.

01:01:10.249 --> 01:01:12.751
| told you to stay out of here!

01:01:17.965 --> 01:01:19.341
It's done.

01:01:19.550 --> 01:01:21.427
Right. Begin the cover-up.

01:01:21.635 --> 01:01:24.471
Maybe we can make
Nunnally out to be the witness.

01:01:24.680 --> 01:01:27.683
We have to make it look like
this was the work of terrorists.

01:01:27.892 --> 01:01:29.768
Anya Alstreim...

01:01:29.977 --> 01:01:33.564
The young girl who came here
a week ago to be schooled in etiquette.

01:01:40.279 --> 01:01:44.575
My Geass power was to cross over
into another person's mind.

01:01:48.787 --> 01:01:52.875
It activated for the first time
as my body was dying.

01:01:53.083 --> 01:01:56.879
| hid inside of Anya and
saved myself from V.V.'s plan.

01:01:57.087 --> 01:02:01.217
Then I realized something.
When I surfaced my consciousness,

01:02:01.425 --> 01:02:04.511
| could speak to C.C.'s mind.

01:02:04.720 --> 01:02:08.182
Once she knew the truth,
C.C. left the directorship to V.V.,

01:02:08.390 --> 01:02:10.684
and then disappeared.

01:02:10.893 --> 01:02:14.563
| talked to my brother about it, however...

01:02:14.772 --> 01:02:19.109
| heard. It's too bad about Marianne.

01:02:19.318 --> 01:02:22.154
My brother lied to me!

01:02:22.363 --> 01:02:26.575
After we had sworn
to create a world without lies!

01:02:26.784 --> 01:02:30.871
How dare you?! Don't try to shift
the blame for this onto the dead V.V.!

01:02:31.080 --> 01:02:33.582
After you sent Nunnally
and me to Japan as hostages...

01:02:33.791 --> 01:02:35.042
It was necessary!

01:02:35.251 --> 01:02:36.335
Necessary for what?!

01:02:36.543 --> 01:02:39.255
You treated us like we were
part of your war machine!

01:02:40.673 --> 01:02:42.758
Milly, when the sun rises,

01:02:42.967 --> 01:02:45.177
I'd like to get a shot
with ground zero in the background.

01:02:45.386 --> 01:02:46.220
Gotcha.

01:02:46.428 --> 01:02:47.388
Sorry about this.

01:02:47.596 --> 01:02:50.015
We'll have some relief coming
from Niigata and Nagoya by afternoon,

01:02:50.224 --> 01:02:50.849
so hang in there.

01:02:51.058 --> 01:02:52.768
Oh, I'm okay.

01:02:59.525 --> 01:03:04.363
We're suppressing the rebel forces
with the help of the Black Knights, but...

01:03:04.571 --> 01:03:06.156
Hm? Is there something else?

01:03:06.365 --> 01:03:09.660
Just how much do you know,
Prince Schneizel?

01:03:09.868 --> 01:03:13.998
How frightening! What are you referring to?

01:03:14.206 --> 01:03:18.544
| used Lelouch.
Knowing the truth all the time,

01:03:18.752 --> 01:03:24.633
| made his survival a priority
to bring my own death to fruition.

01:03:24.842 --> 01:03:25.801
Any regrets?

01:03:26.010 --> 01:03:27.261
Hardly.

01:03:27.469 --> 01:03:30.806
I'm an immortal witch.

01:03:31.015 --> 01:03:33.726
| abandoned my humanity long ago.

01:03:33.934 --> 01:03:36.645
We aren't alike at all.

01:03:36.854 --> 01:03:40.024
C.C., send me over there.

01:03:40.232 --> 01:03:45.696
| have to carry on the wishes of
those whose dreams never came true.

01:03:45.904 --> 01:03:51.869
That's right. I sent you both
to Japan to escape my brother's sight.

01:03:52.077 --> 01:03:55.414
That's also why I had
Marianne's body secretly taken away.

01:03:55.622 --> 01:03:57.082
As long as my body still exists,

01:03:57.291 --> 01:03:59.918
there's the possibility
that I might return to it.

01:04:00.127 --> 01:04:03.714
It was necessary to rewrite
the memories of the witnesses,

01:04:03.922 --> 01:04:08.719
Anya and Nunnally, to keep everything safe.

01:04:08.927 --> 01:04:13.557
Nunnally? You mean her
blindness isn't psychosomatic, but...!

01:04:13.766 --> 01:04:16.560
It was to safeguard Nunnally's life.

01:04:16.769 --> 01:04:20.856
It was necessary to make my brother think

01:04:21.065 --> 01:04:25.361
that Nunnally could not get close to the truth.

01:04:25.569 --> 01:04:29.823
The original plan only
called for one immortal Code,

01:04:30.032 --> 01:04:32.951
but for research to progress,
we needed another Code.

01:04:33.160 --> 01:04:37.373
In short, without C.C., we didn't have
a 100% guarantee that it would work.

01:04:37.581 --> 01:04:42.711
When Marianne was unable
to persuade C.C. to help us,

01:04:42.920 --> 01:04:45.506
we were forced to use you.

01:04:45.714 --> 01:04:48.634
Then... What was the point of me doing this?

01:04:48.842 --> 01:04:51.512
Once the Ragnarok Connection is made,

01:04:51.720 --> 01:04:53.972
there will be no more need
for these sorts of tragedies.

01:04:54.181 --> 01:04:58.394
The masks will vanish.
Everyone can be exactly who they are.

01:04:58.602 --> 01:05:03.649
| see. The battle between
Britannia and the Black Knights...

01:05:03.857 --> 01:05:06.026
It was all to lure out C.C.

01:05:06.235 --> 01:05:10.489
So, from the very beginning,
| was just a nuisance.

01:05:10.697 --> 01:05:12.533
Meaningless noise in this world.

01:05:14.660 --> 01:05:16.745
What do you two think of all this?

01:05:16.954 --> 01:05:19.748
So, you noticed I had appeared.

01:05:19.957 --> 01:05:23.794
You're back to normal now.
It's necessary for this plan, isn't it?

01:05:24.002 --> 01:05:30.551
Exactly. Therefore, there's no sense
in your coming here as well, Kururugi.

01:05:30.759 --> 01:05:34.763
I'm sure. I heard you were already immortal.

01:05:34.972 --> 01:05:37.433
That's why there's something
| want to know for sure.

01:05:37.641 --> 01:05:39.643
The reason you made this thing.

01:05:39.852 --> 01:05:45.816
That's right. It's for what
Euphy and Nunnally want.

01:05:46.024 --> 01:05:48.861
A gentle world.

01:05:49.069 --> 01:05:55.242
C.C., now that we are all here,
the plan can commence.

01:05:55.451 --> 01:05:59.288
| shall grant your wish after it's done.

01:06:12.134 --> 01:06:13.594
What?!

01:06:13.802 --> 01:06:16.513
Huh? Where am I?

01:06:23.270 --> 01:06:25.230
Oh, it's beginning!

01:06:25.439 --> 01:06:28.442
The Sword of Akasha is slaying God!

01:06:29.902 --> 01:06:34.907
Now, once our marks become one,

01:06:35.115 --> 01:06:37.826
the new world will begin!

01:06:38.035 --> 01:06:42.247
Lelouch, why did you want to control the world?

01:06:42.456 --> 01:06:45.125
Don't waste my time with obvious questions.
It was for Nunnally.

01:06:45.334 --> 01:06:48.921
Are you using Nunnally as an excuse?

01:06:49.129 --> 01:06:54.510
You're right. I've fought to protect
everything I thought I wanted to protect.

01:06:54.718 --> 01:06:57.804
To that end, you need to do something.

01:06:58.013 --> 01:07:01.642
The means to that end
require me to reject something.

01:07:01.850 --> 01:07:03.101
Which means...

01:07:03.310 --> 01:07:05.979
Right. I...

01:07:06.188 --> 01:07:09.483
| reject you and your ideas!

01:07:10.859 --> 01:07:15.072
Why do people lie? It's not just
to struggle against each other!

01:07:15.280 --> 01:07:17.324
It's because they seek something!

01:07:17.533 --> 01:07:21.078
A world where it's all right for
everything to stay as it is will stagnate!

01:07:21.286 --> 01:07:25.123
You can't call that life!
It's the equivalent of a world of memories!

01:07:25.332 --> 01:07:29.211
A closed and completed world.
One I wouldn't want to live in!

01:07:29.419 --> 01:07:33.298
Lelouch, are you saying you reject me, as well?

01:07:33.507 --> 01:07:36.969
Is your wish the same
as the emperor's, Mother?

01:07:37.177 --> 01:07:41.265
It will be good to reconnect all
the minds that have been split apart.

01:07:41.473 --> 01:07:45.394
You can be reunited with those
who have died. Even Euphemia.

01:07:47.854 --> 01:07:49.356
Just as I thought.

01:07:49.565 --> 01:07:52.609
You both think that will be a good thing.

01:07:52.818 --> 01:07:55.237
But you're forcing those
good intentions on others!

01:07:55.445 --> 01:07:56.947
And that's no different than evil intentions!

01:07:57.155 --> 01:08:00.534
People will come to accept it in time.

01:08:00.742 --> 01:08:02.494
That time will never come!

01:08:02.703 --> 01:08:05.497
Only one thing is certain.

01:08:05.706 --> 01:08:10.502
Perhaps what you did to Nunnally
and me was out of good intentions,

01:08:10.711 --> 01:08:14.006
but the fact remains that you abandoned us!

01:08:14.214 --> 01:08:15.424
But we were trying to protect you!

01:08:15.632 --> 01:08:18.719
Then why didn't you stop
the war between Japan and Britannia?!

01:08:21.763 --> 01:08:23.473
You both put such a priority on the plan

01:08:23.682 --> 01:08:27.102
that it didn't matter if we were alive or dead.

01:08:27.311 --> 01:08:30.564
That's why you abandoned us!
All you have left are self-serving excuses!

01:08:30.772 --> 01:08:31.607
That's not true!

01:08:31.815 --> 01:08:35.193
You just said it!
The dead will rejoin the living!

01:08:35.402 --> 01:08:37.112
You don't care about the future!

01:08:37.321 --> 01:08:42.492
The future lies beyond
the Ragnarok Connection!

01:08:42.701 --> 01:08:46.163
The gentle world Nunnally spoke of.

01:08:46.371 --> 01:08:50.375
No! The world you spoke
of will be gentle only for you!

01:08:50.584 --> 01:08:52.711
But the world Nunnally wants

01:08:52.919 --> 01:08:56.006
is one where even strangers
can be kind to each other!

01:08:56.214 --> 01:09:02.179
Even if that's true, what of it?
The Ragnarok Connection has already begun!

01:09:02.387 --> 01:09:05.599
You think so? I am Zero!

01:09:05.807 --> 01:09:07.267
The man who works miracles!

01:09:07.476 --> 01:09:11.980
Your Geass won't work on me,
nor on anyone else here!

01:09:12.189 --> 01:09:13.106
No...

01:09:13.315 --> 01:09:15.692
There are many others here, aren't there?

01:09:15.901 --> 01:09:19.529
That's right! Cs' World
is the consciousness of mankind!

01:09:19.738 --> 01:09:21.782
And all men are not equal!

01:09:21.990 --> 01:09:23.575
Both statements are your words!

01:09:23.784 --> 01:09:26.953
And you know my power works
because of that inequality!

01:09:27.162 --> 01:09:32.000
Lelouch, you're a fool!
The power of the king cannot defeat God!

01:09:32.209 --> 01:09:34.795
| don't intend to defeat God! This is a request!

01:09:35.003 --> 01:09:37.881
That's right! Now, I know who I really am!

01:09:38.090 --> 01:09:40.967
God! Collective unconscious!

01:09:43.970 --> 01:09:46.390
Please, don't stop the march of time!

01:09:46.598 --> 01:09:48.850
Lelouch, you ungrateful child...

01:09:49.059 --> 01:09:52.354
Nobody wanted this! Not even Euphy!

01:09:52.562 --> 01:09:57.859
You can't do it! Not God!
Not all of humanity itself!

01:09:58.068 --> 01:10:01.238
Even so, what I want... is the future!

01:10:07.411 --> 01:10:08.078
It can't be!

01:10:08.286 --> 01:10:10.455
The Thought Elevator!

01:10:10.664 --> 01:10:15.419
It's crumbling... The dream I shared
with Marianne and my brother!

01:10:15.627 --> 01:10:20.465
Charles, just stop already.
It was presumptuous for us to try this.

01:10:20.674 --> 01:10:26.346
C.C.! As long as we have our marks, then...

01:10:28.432 --> 01:10:32.394
This is no lie. This is reality's answer to you.

01:10:32.602 --> 01:10:34.187
Darling!

01:10:34.396 --> 01:10:38.024
Impossible... I thought I was immortal!

01:10:38.233 --> 01:10:41.570
We're being swallowed? By Cs' World?

01:10:41.778 --> 01:10:42.696
But what about C.C.?

01:10:42.904 --> 01:10:44.740
Why isn't she disappearing, too?

01:10:44.948 --> 01:10:47.284
You approved of this plan, too!

01:10:47.492 --> 01:10:50.537
I'm sorry. I finally realized.

01:10:50.746 --> 01:10:53.331
The only people you love are yourselves.

01:10:53.540 --> 01:10:56.042
You're wrong! We love Lelouch and Nunnally!

01:10:56.251 --> 01:11:00.297
Do you know?
The meaning of Nunnally's smile?

01:11:00.505 --> 01:11:01.423
Her smile?

01:11:01.631 --> 01:11:07.846
Why don't you understand?!
Nunnally was blind and crippled!

01:11:08.054 --> 01:11:13.310
So she knew there were things
in this world she couldn't do by herself!

01:11:13.518 --> 01:11:14.895
Nunnally's smile...

01:11:15.103 --> 01:11:18.732
Nunnally's smile was the least
she could do to express her gratitude!

01:11:18.940 --> 01:11:22.903
Even now, you spout that nonsense?

01:11:23.111 --> 01:11:27.657
| won't let you call it nonsense!
You will over my dead body!

01:11:27.866 --> 01:11:32.329
Not looking at reality!
Happy to be watching us from afar!

01:11:32.537 --> 01:11:35.540
Don't make me laugh!
There's only one truth here!

01:11:35.749 --> 01:11:40.253
You, my own parents, abandoned us!

01:11:40.462 --> 01:11:44.341
You pathetic fool!

01:11:44.549 --> 01:11:46.885
Suzaku! Stay out of this!

01:11:47.093 --> 01:11:54.476
Refuse me and you will inherit his world!
Schneizel's world!

01:11:54.684 --> 01:12:00.106
Good and evil intentions are
just two sides of the same card, in the end!

01:12:00.315 --> 01:12:02.067
Even so, you...!

01:12:02.275 --> 01:12:07.906
Even so, I reject the world you propose.
Now begone!

01:12:14.788 --> 01:12:16.581
It can't be!

01:12:16.790 --> 01:12:18.124
So it's true?

01:12:18.333 --> 01:12:22.170
The one who sought
after empty ideals is gone?

01:12:24.756 --> 01:12:27.342
C.C., are you going, too?

01:12:27.551 --> 01:12:31.763
You want to at least smile
when you die, right?

01:12:31.972 --> 01:12:35.517
What do you two plan to do now?

01:12:35.725 --> 01:12:39.020
You rejected Charles's plan. You chose reality,

01:12:39.229 --> 01:12:43.567
and the forward march of time. But...

01:12:43.775 --> 01:12:47.445
Before we proceed,
there's something I want to make sure of...

01:12:47.654 --> 01:12:48.905
...from the monarch of deceit.

01:12:49.114 --> 01:12:51.825
In that case, there's something that |, too,
would like to ascertain,

01:12:52.033 --> 01:12:53.493
from the traitorous knight!

01:13:00.041 --> 01:13:02.794
Okay, we're going to go make up
the assignments for the school festival.

01:13:03.003 --> 01:13:07.841
Mm-hmm. Give the swim club
a good location and time, okay?

01:13:08.049 --> 01:13:08.884
No promises.

01:13:09.092 --> 01:13:10.302
Stinge!

01:13:12.220 --> 01:13:14.306
Yes, this is Shirley Fenette.

01:13:17.893 --> 01:13:19.144
Hello?

01:13:19.352 --> 01:13:21.813
Huh? Can you hear me?

01:13:25.358 --> 01:13:26.735
Lulu?

01:13:26.943 --> 01:13:29.779
What's the matter?
You've stopped coming to school.

01:13:29.988 --> 01:13:32.866
I'm sure you have a lot going on, but, um...

01:13:33.950 --> 01:13:38.121
Do you know Jeremiah?
He told us about Nunna, and you...

01:13:41.958 --> 01:13:46.212
You know what? No matter
what happens, I'll still like you, Lulu.

01:13:46.421 --> 01:13:51.009
I'm on your side. You must be trying
to do something now, right?

01:13:51.217 --> 01:13:54.888
If so, I'll help you out. I'll be your...

01:14:00.310 --> 01:14:02.312
One month has passed since the destruction

01:14:02.520 --> 01:14:04.356
caused by the F.L.E.I.J.A. warhead.

01:14:04.564 --> 01:14:06.191
As there will be an important announcement

01:14:06.399 --> 01:14:08.443
from His Majesty Emperor Charles today,

01:14:08.568 --> 01:14:08.652
"Holy Britannian Empire - Capital, Pendragon”

01:14:08.652 --> 01:14:10.654
"Holy Britannian Empire - Capital, Pendragon" we
will be bringing you a live international broadcast

01:14:10.654 --> 01:14:10.862
"Holy Britannian Empire - Capital, Pendragon”

01:14:10.862 --> 01:14:12.614
"Holy Britannian Empire - Capital, Pendragon”
from Pendragon imperial palace.

01:14:12.614 --> 01:14:12.822
"Holy Britannian Empire - Capital, Pendragon”

01:14:12.822 --> 01:14:16.159
"Holy Britannian Empire - Capital, Pendragon” While His Majesty
has not made any public appearances in the past month...

01:14:16.159 --> 01:14:17.285
While His Majesty has not made any
public appearances in the past month...

01:14:17.494 --> 01:14:19.996
Didn't they say the emperor had gone missing?

01:14:20.205 --> 01:14:23.166
Bismarck was the one
who reported that, and he's gone now.

01:14:23.375 --> 01:14:25.502
Aside from that,
where are Schneizel and the others?

01:14:25.710 --> 01:14:28.463
| don't know. There's been
no word from Cambodia.

01:14:28.672 --> 01:14:31.383
Presenting, His Imperial Majesty!

01:14:36.304 --> 01:14:37.389
Where's His Majesty?

01:14:37.597 --> 01:14:39.474
Wh-Why is...?

01:14:40.767 --> 01:14:41.559
It can't be.

01:14:41.768 --> 01:14:42.727
Wha...?!

01:14:42.936 --> 01:14:44.354
What is this?!

01:14:44.562 --> 01:14:47.399
No way. How?!

01:14:49.693 --> 01:14:55.198
| am Lelouch vi Britannia,
the 99th emperor of Britannia.

01:14:55.407 --> 01:14:56.658
What? Is it really?!

01:14:56.866 --> 01:14:58.034
You're alive?

01:14:58.243 --> 01:15:01.913
Yes, Sister. I have returned
from the depths of hell.

01:15:02.122 --> 01:15:03.748
Lelouch, how good to see you!

01:15:03.957 --> 01:15:07.502
| thought you might also be alive
when we found Nunnally,

01:15:07.711 --> 01:15:12.215
but don't you think you're carrying
this joke a bit too far? That's Father's--

01:15:12.424 --> 01:15:17.053
Charles zi Britannia,
the 98th emperor, was killed. By me.

01:15:17.262 --> 01:15:18.763
Huh?

01:15:18.972 --> 01:15:21.766
Which makes me the next emperor!

01:15:21.975 --> 01:15:24.019
What are you talking about?! There's no way!

01:15:24.227 --> 01:15:26.354
Get rid of that fool!

01:15:26.563 --> 01:15:29.441
He's guilty of killing our emperor!

01:15:36.656 --> 01:15:38.700
Suzaku? Why?!

01:15:38.908 --> 01:15:42.829
Allow me to introduce
Suzaku Kururugi, my knight.

01:15:43.038 --> 01:15:45.623
He is the Round beyond the other Rounds.

01:15:45.832 --> 01:15:48.626
| grant him the title of Knight of Zero.

01:15:48.835 --> 01:15:49.961
| knew it.

01:15:50.170 --> 01:15:51.588
Suzaku...

01:15:53.298 --> 01:15:56.009
Lelouch, Sir Suzaku, this just won't do.

01:15:56.217 --> 01:15:58.803
Pulling this bad joke on
an international broadcast!

01:15:59.012 --> 01:16:03.349
Oh, no? Well then, why don't I make
this easy for you all to understand?

01:16:03.558 --> 01:16:05.643
Acknowledge me!

01:16:05.852 --> 01:16:07.771
I'm saying you really have
to stop joking around like...

01:16:11.357 --> 01:16:13.234
Yes, Your Majesty!

01:16:13.443 --> 01:16:15.153
All hail Lelouch!

01:16:15.361 --> 01:16:18.865
All hail Lelouch! All hail Lelouch!

01:16:19.074 --> 01:16:21.076
All hail Lelouch!

01:16:31.795 --> 01:16:36.466
Lelouch vi Britannia does not follow
in the late emperor's footsteps!

01:16:36.674 --> 01:16:39.552
Now is the time for us
to demonstrate our loyalty!

01:16:39.761 --> 01:16:43.014
| don't care if the lost prince
has returned after all this time...

01:16:43.223 --> 01:16:46.434
An interceptor? But only one?

01:16:52.774 --> 01:16:55.443
Lancelot Albion will be enough.

01:16:57.737 --> 01:17:00.281
| can't track it!

01:17:00.490 --> 01:17:03.618
It can't be! He got me already?!

01:17:03.827 --> 01:17:05.995
Hmm? The Albion?!

01:17:11.000 --> 01:17:13.503
A 9th generation
Knightmare Frame, which means...

01:17:13.711 --> 01:17:15.255
Suzaku Kururugi!

01:17:16.089 --> 01:17:17.966
Wake up, Suzaku!

01:17:20.301 --> 01:17:22.262
You can still come back to us!

01:17:23.721 --> 01:17:24.973
Come back?

01:17:25.181 --> 01:17:26.891
You've got it backwards, Gino.

01:17:27.100 --> 01:17:31.146
If you've sworn loyalty to Britannia,
then you belong on my side!

01:17:31.354 --> 01:17:34.607
Or do you intend to stand against Britannia?

01:17:34.816 --> 01:17:36.860
Against Britannia...

01:17:42.282 --> 01:17:44.534
Suzaku Kururugi!

01:17:44.742 --> 01:17:48.496
| heard your objective was
to become the Knight of One!

01:17:48.705 --> 01:17:52.500
However! I am the only Knight of One!

01:17:52.709 --> 01:17:55.753
And I have no intention of
giving up that title to the likes of you!

01:17:55.962 --> 01:17:59.883
| am the Knight of Zero, a rank
that surpasses even the Knight of One!

01:18:00.091 --> 01:18:02.719
A title without a shred of pride!

01:18:08.308 --> 01:18:10.059
How can he know Lancelot's flight path?!

01:18:10.268 --> 01:18:13.396
My Geass allows me to see the future!

01:18:16.482 --> 01:18:17.192
Again!

01:18:17.400 --> 01:18:22.197
Lady Marianne was the only one
I've ever needed to use this power against!

01:18:25.074 --> 01:18:27.410
He can predict my movements? Even so...

01:18:27.619 --> 01:18:31.331
Suzaku! This video is being broadcast
to the world, as we planned.

01:18:31.539 --> 01:18:35.501
Right. For the sake of
the Zero Requiem, I can't lose!

01:18:35.710 --> 01:18:37.629
That's why I'm ordering you to live!

01:18:37.837 --> 01:18:39.881
Yes, Your Majesty!

01:18:40.673 --> 01:18:43.384
My name will always be linked with the title...

01:18:43.593 --> 01:18:45.845
...of mightiest knight in the empire!

01:18:46.054 --> 01:18:47.472
Wh-What?!

01:18:47.680 --> 01:18:50.391
What is this? Is it the machine's abilities...

01:18:52.101 --> 01:18:53.728
...or is it Kururugi's?

01:18:53.937 --> 01:18:57.357
Suzaku... Your willpower is extraordinary.

01:18:57.565 --> 01:19:02.528
Turning my Geass command
to live into an unexpected weapon.

01:19:02.737 --> 01:19:05.490
You are truly a man to be reckoned with!

01:19:05.698 --> 01:19:07.575
Even if you can predict my movements,

01:19:07.784 --> 01:19:09.369
if I do this...!

01:19:09.577 --> 01:19:11.079
Head on?!

01:19:11.287 --> 01:19:13.331
You insult me!

01:19:19.837 --> 01:19:21.965
Lady Marianne!

01:19:30.640 --> 01:19:35.770
Am I a Britannian? And if I'm not...

01:19:35.979 --> 01:19:38.398
...then what am I fighting for?!

01:19:47.782 --> 01:19:49.534
"Britannian Palace - Exelica Garden"

01:19:49.534 --> 01:19:50.910
"Britannian Palace - Exelica Garden"
Soon after ascending the throne,

01:19:50.910 --> 01:19:51.119
"Britannian Palace - Exelica Garden"

01:19:51.119 --> 01:19:53.913
<i>"Britannian Palace - Exelica Garden"
Emperor Lelouch's name became historic.</i>

01:19:53.913 --> 01:19:54.122
"Britannian Palace - Exelica Garden"

01:19:54.122 --> 01:19:54.247
"Britannian Palace - Exelica Garden"
Because he destroyed Britannian culture.

01:19:54.247 --> 01:19:56.416
Because he destroyed Britannian culture.

01:19:56.624 --> 01:19:59.168
The real work is yet to come.

01:19:59.377 --> 01:20:01.963
| am about to spill a sea of blood.

01:20:02.171 --> 01:20:07.468
Enough blood to wipe all memory of
the massacre princess from people's minds.

01:20:07.677 --> 01:20:09.220
Lelouch, are you saying...?

01:20:09.429 --> 01:20:12.432
It wasn't just Euphy. It was Nunnally, too.

01:20:12.640 --> 01:20:16.602
We've both lost much. Far, far too much.

01:20:16.811 --> 01:20:22.900
But to advance toward the future,
we need to take over the world.

01:20:23.109 --> 01:20:24.819
Just saying it makes me laugh.

01:20:25.028 --> 01:20:28.740
Yet you're both intent on doing it, aren't you?

01:20:28.948 --> 01:20:29.949
Yes.

01:20:30.158 --> 01:20:32.702
For the sake of the Zero Requiem.

01:20:32.910 --> 01:20:35.204
Yes, Your Majesty.

01:20:35.413 --> 01:20:39.292
Well then, what will you do about
the problem at hand, Your Majesty?

01:20:39.500 --> 01:20:43.254
Hmm. I took over Britannia for that, but...

01:20:43.463 --> 01:20:46.799
Is it true? About what Schneizel is thinking?

01:20:47.008 --> 01:20:49.052
Yes. Prince Schneizel appears to have changed,

01:20:49.260 --> 01:20:51.846
now that he has obtained F.L.E.I.J.A.

01:20:52.055 --> 01:20:54.724
Yeah. And here I thought
that after Emperor Charles,

01:20:54.932 --> 01:20:58.311
Prince Schneizel would preserve
the balance of power.

01:20:58.519 --> 01:21:02.106
It's crazy, right? Imagine,
the prince being so magnanimous.

01:21:02.315 --> 01:21:06.152
What's even more surprising is that
this bunch would be opposing him.

01:21:06.361 --> 01:21:09.655
All of us trying to take responsibility
for our means and our ends.

01:21:09.864 --> 01:21:12.533
Even so, there's no need
to take things any further--

01:21:12.742 --> 01:21:15.703
No, you're wrong about that, C.C.

01:21:15.912 --> 01:21:18.956
After sending Sayoko to Cambodia,
| can no longer reach her.

01:21:19.165 --> 01:21:20.416
Which would mean...

01:21:20.625 --> 01:21:23.294
we are left with only one reality.

01:21:23.503 --> 01:21:28.508
We have to move the plan to the
next phase before Schneizel can act.

01:21:28.716 --> 01:21:30.676
Hey, you guys, did you hear?!

01:21:30.885 --> 01:21:32.512
Emperor Lelouch's announcement, you mean?

01:21:32.720 --> 01:21:37.517
Yeah. Can you imagine, petitioning
to join the United Federation of Nations?

01:21:37.725 --> 01:21:42.271
Seriously, what is Lelouch thinking?

01:21:45.233 --> 01:21:46.401
Huh?

01:21:51.823 --> 01:21:53.408
We're coming to you from Ashford Academy,

01:21:53.616 --> 01:21:56.702
the site designated by His Majesty Lelouch,
emperor of Britannia.

01:21:56.911 --> 01:22:00.957
It is here, today, that the Britannian
Empire's petition to join the U.F.N...

01:22:02.333 --> 01:22:04.585
It's the Britannian emperor's plane!

01:22:12.051 --> 01:22:14.637
Lelouch, is it really you?

01:22:14.846 --> 01:22:16.431
Sorry about that!

01:22:16.639 --> 01:22:20.143
Emperor Lelouch has just
landed inside the school grounds.

01:22:23.980 --> 01:22:25.690
Lelouch!

01:22:25.898 --> 01:22:28.025
Lelouch, please tell me!

01:22:28.234 --> 01:22:31.320
--Why didn't you ever tell me?!
--Hey!

01:22:31.529 --> 01:22:34.323
How dare you disrespect
the Britannian emperor like that?!

01:22:34.532 --> 01:22:38.244
But... But we're friends! He's...

01:22:38.453 --> 01:22:40.329
Lelouch is...!

01:22:41.539 --> 01:22:43.040
Hey!

01:22:46.544 --> 01:22:48.171
Nostalgic, isn't it?

01:22:49.630 --> 01:22:53.926
I'm... I'm grateful to you.

01:22:54.135 --> 01:22:58.848
If it weren't for you, we would
have died in the Shinjuku ghetto.

01:22:59.056 --> 01:23:01.559
There never would
have been any Black Knights.

01:23:01.767 --> 01:23:08.191
| was glad. Proud and
honored to be needed by Zero.

01:23:08.399 --> 01:23:13.321
But... When I learned you were Zero,
| didn't understand anymore.

01:23:13.529 --> 01:23:18.034
Even so, the man I saw
fighting against Britannia...

01:23:18.242 --> 01:23:23.331
Now you've joined up with Suzaku.
What do you want to do now?

01:23:24.707 --> 01:23:28.127
Do you just want power?
Or is it status you seek?

01:23:28.336 --> 01:23:32.131
Or... Is this just another game to you?

01:23:32.340 --> 01:23:35.384
| still speak with Ohgi
and the others these days.

01:23:35.593 --> 01:23:39.305
We wonder if you were really just using us.

01:23:39.514 --> 01:23:44.060
About whether we fell
for Schneizel's strategy. Um...

01:23:45.853 --> 01:23:49.774
Lelouch... What am I to you?!

01:23:49.982 --> 01:23:54.070
Why did you tell me to
live back aboard the lkaruga?!

01:24:10.628 --> 01:24:14.131
Goodbye, Lelouch.

01:24:14.340 --> 01:24:18.344
The supreme council is scheduled
to meet in the gymnasium.

01:24:23.891 --> 01:24:25.935
Goodbye, Kallen.

01:24:30.356 --> 01:24:35.111
Chairman Kaguya Sumeragi
of the U.F.N. supreme council.

01:24:35.319 --> 01:24:40.741
| would like for the Holy Britannian Empire to
participate in the United Federation of Nations.

01:24:45.705 --> 01:24:47.540
Lock Master Zero away?

01:24:47.748 --> 01:24:52.378
Yes. Since Britannia has concealed
Zero's true identity and Geass from us,

01:24:52.587 --> 01:24:55.131
| think it is in our best interest
to not say anything.

01:24:55.339 --> 01:24:57.592
Zero is a hero of unknown origin.

01:24:57.800 --> 01:25:01.971
| humbly recommend that we treat him
as a symbol of the people's liberation.

01:25:03.556 --> 01:25:05.683
What will it be, Kaguya Sumeragi?

01:25:05.891 --> 01:25:10.313
Suzaku Kururugi, you traitorous fiend!

01:25:10.521 --> 01:25:14.150
Lelouch has taken each nation's
representatives hostage? Why?

01:25:14.358 --> 01:25:18.195
| don't know! I thought he
was delivering Britannia as an ally,

01:25:18.404 --> 01:25:19.822
but all of a sudden,
he's sending out its forces!

01:25:20.031 --> 01:25:22.408
Deputy Commander! There is word
that a F.L.E.I.J.A. has been dropped

01:25:22.617 --> 01:25:23.826
on the Britannian capital, Pendragon!

01:25:24.035 --> 01:25:25.995
Huh?!

01:25:26.203 --> 01:25:30.166
What is this? What the hell is happening?

01:25:30.166 --> 01:25:30.499
"Imperial Capital, Pendragon™
What is this? What the hell is happening?

01:25:30.499 --> 01:25:30.708
"Imperial Capital, Pendragon™

01:25:30.708 --> 01:25:33.544
"Imperial Capital, Pendragon™ The radius of
annihilation is approximately 100 kilometers.

01:25:33.544 --> 01:25:33.753
"Imperial Capital, Pendragon™

01:25:33.753 --> 01:25:33.919
"Imperial Capital, Pendragon™ | think it was caused
by a F.L.E.I.J.A. that had its limiter removed.

01:25:33.919 --> 01:25:36.589
| think it was caused by a F.L.E.I.J.A.
that had its limiter removed.

01:25:36.797 --> 01:25:39.967
There's a giant fortress
overhead that was developed

01:25:40.176 --> 01:25:41.886
by the Tromo Agency of Cambodia.

01:25:49.352 --> 01:25:52.063
Lelouch! It's just as you guessed!

01:25:52.271 --> 01:25:55.524
Yes. We can assume that the F.L.E.I.J.A.
warheads they initially produced

01:25:55.733 --> 01:25:59.570
have been loaded aboard
the sky fortress Damocles.

01:25:59.779 --> 01:26:02.323
They must have wanted
to secure the U.F.N. completely

01:26:02.531 --> 01:26:04.825
before he made his move.

01:26:06.619 --> 01:26:09.497
The only one who would know
the imperial private channel is...

01:26:12.416 --> 01:26:16.128
Does it feel good to
subdue other people, Lelouch?

01:26:16.337 --> 01:26:17.588
Schneizel.

01:26:17.797 --> 01:26:21.634
I've taken custody of
all the F.L.E.I.J.A. warheads.

01:26:21.842 --> 01:26:24.595
Are you drawing your bow
against the Britannian emperor?

01:26:24.804 --> 01:26:28.599
I'm afraid I don't recognize you as emperor.

01:26:28.808 --> 01:26:29.975
| see.

01:26:30.184 --> 01:26:32.645
| suppose you think you
are better suited to be emperor.

01:26:32.853 --> 01:26:37.024
No. You're mistaken, Lelouch.

01:26:37.233 --> 01:26:40.152
The one best suited to be Britannia's emperor...

01:26:40.361 --> 01:26:41.821
...is her.

01:26:49.370 --> 01:26:50.496
N...!

01:26:50.705 --> 01:26:52.248
Nunnally!

01:26:52.456 --> 01:26:57.628
It has been too long, big brother. I am...

01:26:57.837 --> 01:27:00.464
...the one and only emperor.

01:27:00.673 --> 01:27:01.674
Is it really true?!

01:27:01.882 --> 01:27:03.092
Looks like it was a F.L.E.I.J.A. warhead.

01:27:03.300 --> 01:27:05.344
The thing that wiped out the Tokyo Settlement?

01:27:05.553 --> 01:27:09.473
--Was it an accident?
--But I've heard all the F.L.E.I.J.A.s they manufactured are gone.

01:27:09.682 --> 01:27:12.101
Stop spreading wild stories!

01:27:12.309 --> 01:27:13.477
Even if it's just rumors,

01:27:13.686 --> 01:27:15.771
it's imprudent to discuss
the capital's destruction!

01:27:15.980 --> 01:27:19.233
No, I'm afraid it's true.

01:27:19.442 --> 01:27:20.818
What?!

01:27:21.986 --> 01:27:25.573
Please... Take me to Master Lelouch!

01:27:27.700 --> 01:27:30.494
N-Nunnally...

01:27:30.703 --> 01:27:32.413
You're still alive!

01:27:32.621 --> 01:27:35.833
Yes, thanks to Brother Schneizel.

01:27:36.041 --> 01:27:37.001
Nunnally...

01:27:37.209 --> 01:27:40.212
Do you understand what Schneizel has done?

01:27:40.421 --> 01:27:44.800
Yes. He's attacked the capital,
Pendragon, with a F.L.E.I.J.A. warhead.

01:27:45.009 --> 01:27:46.719
If you know that, then why...?!

01:27:46.927 --> 01:27:49.847
Are you saying using Geass is better?!

01:27:51.182 --> 01:27:55.936
You and big brother have been
lying to me all along, haven't you?

01:27:56.145 --> 01:27:58.564
You've kept the truth from me all this time.

01:27:58.773 --> 01:28:00.941
But I found out.

01:28:02.401 --> 01:28:04.987
Big brother, you were
Zero all along, weren't you?

01:28:06.739 --> 01:28:13.996
Why?! Were you doing it for my sake?
If that's the case, then I...

01:28:15.122 --> 01:28:19.835
For your sake? I see my little sister
is as presumptuous as ever!

01:28:20.044 --> 01:28:24.173
Do you think it's natural for people
to always help you out of pity?

01:28:24.381 --> 01:28:25.966
All you do is criticize the actions of others

01:28:26.175 --> 01:28:28.969
while your own hands remain unsullied.

01:28:29.178 --> 01:28:33.307
You are the very embodiment of
the old aristocracy which I have rejected.

01:28:33.516 --> 01:28:35.518
You... don't...

01:28:35.726 --> 01:28:37.228
| do this for no one!

01:28:37.436 --> 01:28:40.481
It is for my own benefit that I take the world!

01:28:40.689 --> 01:28:44.109
If you choose to ally yourself
with Schneizel and stand in my way,

01:28:44.318 --> 01:28:47.780
| have no choice but to crush you without mercy!

01:28:47.988 --> 01:28:50.157
Big brother! Listen to me--

01:28:54.161 --> 01:28:55.621
Are you all right, Nunnally?

01:28:55.830 --> 01:28:58.457
That must have been hard for you.

01:28:58.666 --> 01:29:02.086
| thought showing him the power of
the F.L.E.I.J.A. would lead him to surrender.

01:29:02.294 --> 01:29:07.633
Brother Schneizel... Are the people
of Pendragon really all right?

01:29:07.842 --> 01:29:13.222
You needn't worry. We gave warning
for them to evacuate beforehand.

01:29:13.430 --> 01:29:18.143
But, now... Now we'll have to use them
on people. On big brother, right?

01:29:18.352 --> 01:29:21.772
If they stand in the
way of world peace, we will.

01:29:21.981 --> 01:29:24.024
Brother Schneizel...

01:29:24.233 --> 01:29:28.195
Will you let me have the
F.L.E.I.J.A. firing switch, please?

01:29:28.404 --> 01:29:31.949
| can't fight or protect anything myself.

01:29:32.157 --> 01:29:36.495
That's why, at the very least...
| want this sin to be on my shoulders.

01:29:42.209 --> 01:29:44.420
Lelouch.

01:29:44.628 --> 01:29:47.381
Our strategic objective remains unchanged.

01:29:47.590 --> 01:29:51.427
We can't stop this just
because Nunnally is still alive!

01:29:51.635 --> 01:29:54.054
What's the point of the Zero Requiem, then?!

01:29:55.973 --> 01:29:57.975
Remember your promise!

01:29:58.183 --> 01:29:59.476
Suzaku...

01:29:59.685 --> 01:30:02.396
I am his sword.

01:30:02.605 --> 01:30:05.649
| rid him of his enemies and his own weakness.

01:30:05.858 --> 01:30:09.904
So, C.C., you must become his shield!

01:30:10.112 --> 01:30:12.031
Protecting him is your duty.

01:30:12.239 --> 01:30:14.074
That's only what you think.

01:30:14.283 --> 01:30:17.953
Lelouch is your accomplice, isn't he?

01:30:18.162 --> 01:30:20.539
My accomplice, huh?

01:30:21.999 --> 01:30:23.292
What about it?

01:30:23.500 --> 01:30:26.253
Y-You mean the people of Pendragon were...!

01:30:26.462 --> 01:30:27.713
| made them vanish.

01:30:27.922 --> 01:30:32.593
Happier for them than a life
swearing loyalty to Lelouch, isn't it?

01:30:32.801 --> 01:30:34.261
But, you told Nunnally...

01:30:34.470 --> 01:30:36.305
Lies are expedient.

01:30:36.513 --> 01:30:39.725
No need to tell Nunnally
anything that would get in the way

01:30:39.934 --> 01:30:42.603
of her opposition to Lelouch, is there?

01:30:42.811 --> 01:30:45.564
Is that how you use people, brother?

01:30:45.773 --> 01:30:50.569
Even civilians who have rejected war
depend on the police, don't they?

01:30:50.778 --> 01:30:54.281
Everyone understands
that crime cannot be stopped,

01:30:54.490 --> 01:30:58.077
because people can't
help the desires they have.

01:30:58.285 --> 01:31:01.121
That's why we don't need
to win hearts or use ideology.

01:31:01.330 --> 01:31:04.792
Why not bring peace to the world
using a system backed by force?

01:31:07.336 --> 01:31:08.212
You...

01:31:08.420 --> 01:31:09.713
Magnificent!

01:31:09.922 --> 01:31:12.841
| knew I was right to come with you!

01:31:13.050 --> 01:31:16.053
Surpassing Zero's chaos to
a state of perfect nothingness,

01:31:16.261 --> 01:31:17.930
followed by a kaleidoscopic transformation!

01:31:18.138 --> 01:31:21.684
Prince Schneizel, we've made
contact with the Black Knights.

01:31:21.892 --> 01:31:24.603
They say if you plan to kill Lelouch,
they're willing to help.

01:31:24.812 --> 01:31:26.230
Thank you.

01:31:26.438 --> 01:31:28.857
The masses who suffer Lelouch's tyranny

01:31:29.066 --> 01:31:31.485
will have no choice but to cling
to something slightly better.

01:31:31.694 --> 01:31:35.280
Are you saying that's why you've let
Lelouch get away with this until now?

01:31:35.489 --> 01:31:37.950
It was the way to minimize the damage.

01:31:38.158 --> 01:31:42.871
Even if we lose 1 or 2 billion lives,
for a permanent peace...

01:31:43.080 --> 01:31:47.084
You're wrong! Peace given by force is no peace!

01:31:55.384 --> 01:31:57.594
You make me sad, Cornelia.

01:31:58.595 --> 01:32:04.309
Schneizel had another escape plane
as a decoy during the battle for Tokyo.

01:32:04.518 --> 01:32:05.936
And so...

01:32:06.145 --> 01:32:09.064
Then the plane destroyed
by the F.L.E.I.J.A. was the decoy.

01:32:09.273 --> 01:32:13.777
He's trying to use Miss Nunnally
to control Master Lelouch!

01:32:13.986 --> 01:32:15.612
You're Japanese, aren't you?

01:32:15.821 --> 01:32:19.116
Why come to Master Lelouch
instead of the Black Knights?

01:32:21.452 --> 01:32:25.164
You devote yourself
to chivalry as well, don't you?

01:32:25.372 --> 01:32:27.458
Perhaps you're right.

01:32:30.294 --> 01:32:33.630
You understand why
I'm doing this evil, don't you?

01:32:33.839 --> 01:32:37.968
Besides, under the rule of Damocles,
people will become lifeless symbols.

01:32:38.177 --> 01:32:42.514
But Nunnally is aboard Damocles.

01:32:42.723 --> 01:32:44.975
All you've done has been for her sake.

01:32:45.184 --> 01:32:48.729
| can't treat her differently anymore.

01:32:48.937 --> 01:32:51.774
He who holds the power
of a king has a responsibility.

01:32:51.982 --> 01:32:57.446
We can't stop now, for the
sake of all those who have died.

01:32:57.654 --> 01:33:00.240
Right, C.C.?

01:33:09.041 --> 01:33:13.378
With the destruction of Pendragon,
the capital of the Holy Britannian Empire,

01:33:13.587 --> 01:33:15.547
their internal administration
has been paralyzed.

01:33:15.756 --> 01:33:19.885
With them confronting the armies
of every Area as well as the Black Knights,

01:33:20.094 --> 01:33:21.512
they can't make any false moves.

01:33:21.720 --> 01:33:24.431
In short, the only force Lelouch
can send against us here

01:33:24.640 --> 01:33:26.850
is the division he brought to reoccupy Japan.

01:33:27.059 --> 01:33:31.355
However, this balance of power
can collapse at any time.

01:33:31.563 --> 01:33:35.859
To minimize damage,
the time to confront him is now!

01:33:36.068 --> 01:33:40.906
Now that Schneizel has joined up with us,
our forces are evenly matched.

01:33:41.115 --> 01:33:44.076
We don't intend to approve of
Damocles's use of F.L.E.I.J.A. weaponry,

01:33:44.284 --> 01:33:48.413
but uniting the world
has priority here. This battle...

01:33:48.622 --> 01:33:52.292
This battle is a showdown
with control of the world at stake!

01:33:52.501 --> 01:33:54.545
If we defeat Schneizel and the Black Knights,

01:33:54.753 --> 01:33:57.422
then there will be none left
to stand in our way!

01:33:57.631 --> 01:34:01.718
The world shall be destroyed,
and then re-created by Lelouch,

01:34:01.927 --> 01:34:04.388
the one, true emperor of Britannia!

01:34:04.596 --> 01:34:05.722
Smash them!

01:34:05.931 --> 01:34:07.808
Smash the enemy! Smash Schneizel!

01:34:08.016 --> 01:34:10.561
Smash the sky fortress Damocles!

01:34:10.769 --> 01:34:15.482
We have nothing to fear!
My name is the future of this world!

01:34:15.691 --> 01:34:17.776
All hail Lelouch!

01:34:20.487 --> 01:34:21.822
Lelouch...

01:34:23.448 --> 01:34:26.952
I'll mnake both of you into recordings.

01:34:27.161 --> 01:34:28.954
Are you sure Anya will be all right?

01:34:29.163 --> 01:34:31.707
She appears to have her memories
tangled up due to the Geass.

01:34:31.915 --> 01:34:33.584
We can count on her on the battlefield.

01:34:33.792 --> 01:34:36.962
Her day-to-day memories may be
impeded, but it won't be a problem.

01:34:37.171 --> 01:34:40.090
Oh? On an open channel, too.

01:34:40.299 --> 01:34:42.551
You look well, Schneizel.

01:34:44.386 --> 01:34:47.890
Lelouch, if you're going
to surrender, now is the time.

01:34:48.098 --> 01:34:50.726
We have F.L.E.I.J.A.s here, ready to use.

01:34:50.934 --> 01:34:54.354
F.L.E.I.J.A.s? I wonder
if you'd dare to fire them.

01:34:54.563 --> 01:34:56.773
Considering I have the U.F.N. representatives

01:34:56.982 --> 01:34:58.650
aboard the Avalon with me.

01:34:58.859 --> 01:35:01.111
He's hiding behind the hostages?!

01:35:02.613 --> 01:35:04.281
| can't believe he'd go this far!

01:35:04.489 --> 01:35:09.870
Indeed. However, Lelouch,
it's a small price to pay for world peace.

01:35:10.078 --> 01:35:11.830
Don't shoot, Schneizel!

01:35:12.039 --> 01:35:16.210
| heard the U.F.N. members have
elected substitute representatives.

01:35:16.418 --> 01:35:18.086
We're ready for the worst.

01:35:18.295 --> 01:35:22.925
But that doesn't mean
their lives are to be thrown away!

01:35:26.386 --> 01:35:29.640
Deploy the Shen Hu. Transmit
the command structure to all forces!

01:35:29.848 --> 01:35:30.557
Yes, sir.

01:35:30.766 --> 01:35:32.809
Then shall we have at each other?

01:35:33.018 --> 01:35:34.937
Indeed.

01:35:35.145 --> 01:35:37.356
Kannon, just as you predicted.

01:35:37.564 --> 01:35:40.776
Yes. Now the Black Knights
are yours to command.

01:35:40.984 --> 01:35:44.196
Ha. Transmit pattern Sigma to all forces.

01:35:46.240 --> 01:35:50.035
Enemy forces deploying into
a wide-field aerial formation.

01:35:50.244 --> 01:35:52.913
He's coming at me
with conventional tactics? Good.

01:35:53.121 --> 01:35:55.916
Stretch our left wing!
Assume Half-Moon Arhat formation!

01:35:56.124 --> 01:35:58.210
Yes, Your Majesty!

01:36:00.837 --> 01:36:02.589
The enemy's main unit is undermanned.

01:36:02.798 --> 01:36:04.383
Have Gino's unit advance.

01:36:04.591 --> 01:36:06.551
<i>Keep the enemy's left wing from extending!</i>

01:36:06.760 --> 01:36:08.387
Yes, Your Highness!

01:36:10.264 --> 01:36:11.890
Checking my move, huh?

01:36:12.099 --> 01:36:13.684
Move our left wing back!

01:36:13.892 --> 01:36:15.602
That will break our formation!

01:36:15.811 --> 01:36:16.979
Very well!

01:36:18.522 --> 01:36:20.440
Gino, halt your advance!

01:36:20.649 --> 01:36:22.943
Why? We should strike now
while their formation is breaking.

01:36:23.151 --> 01:36:24.569
He's baiting us with an opening.

01:36:24.778 --> 01:36:26.238
I'm not taking it.

01:36:26.446 --> 01:36:28.448
Not falling for it, huh?

01:36:28.657 --> 01:36:31.076
Switch main battle plan to Big Dipper formation!

01:36:33.787 --> 01:36:37.749
Unit 6, follow Anya and move to
the northeast, elevation 40 degrees!

01:36:39.167 --> 01:36:41.211
Bombardment unit, prep for anti-air combat!

01:36:41.420 --> 01:36:44.298
Anya, stop there and climb 200 meters!

01:36:45.632 --> 01:36:48.135
What the hell! Nobody's fighting at all!

01:36:48.343 --> 01:36:52.639
You're wrong. A battle between
two masters is decided in an instant.

01:36:52.848 --> 01:36:56.143
An invisible battle is now raging
between the two of them.

01:37:01.315 --> 01:37:04.318
We have to hurry. The battle's already begun.

01:37:06.862 --> 01:37:09.072
They're surrounding us!

01:37:09.281 --> 01:37:12.659
Counterattack! Reinforce the
front line with Suzaku's Lancelot!

01:37:12.868 --> 01:37:16.371
Hold at combat speed 4!
Send Ward's unit out as well!

01:37:16.580 --> 01:37:21.335
You haven't changed, Lelouch.
You like to attack more than defend.

01:37:21.543 --> 01:37:23.879
Which leaves me a small window of opportunity.

01:37:24.087 --> 01:37:24.921
Xing-ke?

01:37:25.130 --> 01:37:28.216
Heh... He's already incorporated
our skills into his tactics, has he?

01:37:28.425 --> 01:37:30.927
Enemy left wing, advancing!

01:37:32.429 --> 01:37:35.015
Give no quarter! Live up to
His Majesty's confidence in us!

01:37:39.353 --> 01:37:42.481
If we can defeat Lelouch, this all will end!

01:37:47.527 --> 01:37:49.821
If we break the line here
and turn this into a free-for-all...!

01:37:56.244 --> 01:37:58.705
They're breaking through!

01:37:58.914 --> 01:38:00.290
We're being cut up...

01:38:00.499 --> 01:38:02.125
Shall I recall Suzaku?

01:38:02.334 --> 01:38:04.669
No, that's what Schneizel wants us to do.

01:38:04.878 --> 01:38:07.506
Withdraw the battle line! Regroup our forces!

01:38:07.714 --> 01:38:09.883
Enemy fleet falling back.

01:38:11.551 --> 01:38:12.886
Don't lose this chance!

01:38:13.095 --> 01:38:14.304
Press the attack!

01:38:19.434 --> 01:38:22.813
Guren, you're too far out!
Match pace with us and we'll surround them!

01:38:23.021 --> 01:38:25.190
| know, but...!

01:38:26.108 --> 01:38:29.611
Don't be in a rush! If we defeat their vanguard,
the Avalon will be left isolated!

01:38:31.822 --> 01:38:33.949
Dreadnought destroyed!
They're breaking through!

01:38:34.157 --> 01:38:38.328
So, the Black Knights are
this strong an enemy, are they?

01:38:38.537 --> 01:38:40.664
However, as for my own troops...

01:38:40.872 --> 01:38:42.999
For His Majesty!

01:38:47.087 --> 01:38:52.676
It's heartbreaking. Seeing soldiers
controlled by Geass. Therefore...!

01:38:53.718 --> 01:38:56.346
| suppose now is the time. Smash both wings.

01:38:56.555 --> 01:38:58.640
Bow-mounted hadron scatter cannon, set!

01:38:58.849 --> 01:39:00.600
Move squad 7 out of the firing angle!

01:39:00.809 --> 01:39:02.644
Gefjun control, synched.

01:39:02.853 --> 01:39:03.520
Ready to fire!

01:39:03.728 --> 01:39:06.690
Target both enemy wings. Fire!

01:39:08.692 --> 01:39:12.779
Zero, it's a shame it had to turn out like this.

01:39:14.364 --> 01:39:15.115
Lelouch!

01:39:15.323 --> 01:39:19.536
Right. I'm impressed.
You've forced me to use this plan, now.

01:39:25.041 --> 01:39:25.709
Dammit!

01:39:25.917 --> 01:39:27.627
Energy reaction, right below us!

01:39:27.836 --> 01:39:29.087
What?! Impossible...

01:39:29.296 --> 01:39:30.922
He timed this to...?!

01:39:32.382 --> 01:39:35.260
All forces! Raise radiant shields!

01:39:37.762 --> 01:39:39.139
Zero!

01:39:41.558 --> 01:39:46.188
Ohgi, please respond! Minami! Rakshata!

01:39:48.940 --> 01:39:50.692
It... It can't be!

01:39:50.901 --> 01:39:53.987
He used the Sakuradite in the mine?

01:39:54.196 --> 01:39:58.325
This has destroyed
Lelouch's ground forces as well.

01:39:58.533 --> 01:40:00.327
| was careless!

01:40:00.535 --> 01:40:06.041
That's Lelouch's basic tactic.
But how can he sacrifice his own forces?!

01:40:07.918 --> 01:40:11.630
This has left the enemy's strength
nearly depleted. That leaves Damocles...

01:40:11.838 --> 01:40:13.423
...for us to hit!

01:40:14.716 --> 01:40:19.054
Unfortunately, it's you
who have been checked here.

01:40:19.262 --> 01:40:23.225
Nunnally, targeting is complete.
Now that the Black Knights have been smashed,

01:40:23.433 --> 01:40:25.352
we must use F.L.E.I.J.A.'s power.

01:40:25.560 --> 01:40:28.021
Y-Yes...

01:40:30.232 --> 01:40:34.402
With this act,
| will wipe away big brother's sins!

01:40:36.154 --> 01:40:37.697
Incoming! It's a F.L.E.I.J.A.!

01:40:37.906 --> 01:40:40.575
So, here's where he's fired it.
Special equipment division 3!

01:40:40.784 --> 01:40:42.577
Yes, Your Majesty!

01:40:46.122 --> 01:40:49.960
Avalon will continue to fall back.
All forces, charge at Damocles.

01:40:50.168 --> 01:40:53.797
Make them keep firing F.L.E.I.J.A.s
until they exhaust their stock!

01:41:01.054 --> 01:41:02.764
Ohgi! Ohgi!

01:41:02.973 --> 01:41:04.516
Ohgi!

01:41:04.724 --> 01:41:06.476
Is this any time to be playing dead?!

01:41:06.685 --> 01:41:10.981
I... I don't believe it. You two shielded us?

01:41:11.189 --> 01:41:13.567
We were only able
to protect the bridge, though.

01:41:13.775 --> 01:41:16.194
You're on your own now.

01:41:16.403 --> 01:41:17.654
Let's go, Kallen!

01:41:17.862 --> 01:41:19.781
Oh please, look who's giving orders now.

01:41:22.617 --> 01:41:24.327
Another F.L.E.I.LJ.A...

01:41:27.455 --> 01:41:30.250
Twammi fleet, annihilated!
Should the operation...

01:41:30.458 --> 01:41:33.962
The operation will continue!
The Avalon will continue to fall back!

01:41:34.170 --> 01:41:35.797
Keep our distance from Damocles!

01:41:36.006 --> 01:41:37.841
All units, attack in waves

01:41:38.049 --> 01:41:40.719
and force Damocles
to continue launching F.L.E.I.J.A.s!

01:41:42.429 --> 01:41:45.932
Nunnally, we're ready to fire the next one.

01:41:46.141 --> 01:41:47.934
R-Right...

01:41:52.022 --> 01:41:54.149
It renders tactics useless.

01:41:54.357 --> 01:41:55.567
Even so...

01:41:55.775 --> 01:41:57.485
if I get in close,

01:41:57.694 --> 01:41:59.529
they won't be able to use it!

01:42:01.114 --> 01:42:02.324
A blaze luminous!

01:42:02.532 --> 01:42:03.700
That huge?!

01:42:03.908 --> 01:42:05.368
Damocles was originally built

01:42:05.577 --> 01:42:09.164
to achieve absolute air superiority.

01:42:10.498 --> 01:42:14.628
If it keeps ascending, we'll lose
our chance to do anything against it!

01:42:14.836 --> 01:42:17.047
Suzaku! Can you break
through those defenses?

01:42:17.255 --> 01:42:20.800
I'm trying! But their power output
is in a different league from mine!

01:42:21.009 --> 01:42:23.762
| don't think they can fire
a F.L.E.L.J.A. now, though.

01:42:23.970 --> 01:42:26.056
And our attacks can't
get through to them, either.

01:42:26.264 --> 01:42:28.099
We may as well be spectators now.

01:42:28.308 --> 01:42:29.768
Is there nothing left but for the world to cower

01:42:29.976 --> 01:42:32.020
before the overwhelming might of F.L.E.I.J.A.s?

01:42:32.228 --> 01:42:34.522
Well, that achieves a sort of peace, too.

01:42:34.731 --> 01:42:37.984
Mass our remaining forces around the Avalon!

01:42:38.193 --> 01:42:40.779
We'll assault Damocles
with the hostages aboard here!

01:42:40.987 --> 01:42:41.946
Sure you wanna do that?

01:42:42.155 --> 01:42:45.450
Your return here means you've
almost figured it out, I presume.

01:42:45.659 --> 01:42:49.245
The rest depends on
you and Suzaku, Your Majesty.

01:42:52.582 --> 01:42:54.000
From behind?!

01:42:57.587 --> 01:43:00.256
The Black Knights!

01:43:00.465 --> 01:43:02.133
| swear I will defeat you myself!

01:43:02.342 --> 01:43:04.427
You snuck around me, Xing-ke?!

01:43:04.636 --> 01:43:07.180
| won't let the Avalon be shot down!

01:43:14.104 --> 01:43:15.647
Xing-ke, I'll stop you!

01:43:15.855 --> 01:43:18.108
Justice weighs on my side!

01:43:26.116 --> 01:43:27.409
It's over!

01:43:27.617 --> 01:43:29.661
--What?!
--Kururugi!

01:43:29.869 --> 01:43:31.287
I'm amazed you can
still fight in your condition!

01:43:31.496 --> 01:43:35.709
It disgusts me to think that you
abandoned your nation to climb in rank!

01:43:35.917 --> 01:43:37.752
What do you have to fight for?!

01:43:37.961 --> 01:43:40.338
All I want is a future!

01:43:40.547 --> 01:43:43.174
Your future is worthless!

01:43:45.802 --> 01:43:46.678
I've failed!

01:43:46.678 --> 01:43:47.095
"Eject"
I've failed!

01:43:47.095 --> 01:43:47.137
N eject n

01:43:49.139 --> 01:43:50.682
Tohdoh!

01:43:57.689 --> 01:43:58.481
Damn!

01:43:58.690 --> 01:44:01.234
Ah! I have to admit, they did well.

01:44:01.443 --> 01:44:04.446
Primary float unit, damaged. Damage level 75%.

01:44:04.654 --> 01:44:07.615
We're falling... The Avalon is falling!

01:44:10.785 --> 01:44:11.619
They're trying to get in!

01:44:11.828 --> 01:44:13.371
Hold it, hold it, hold it!

01:44:13.580 --> 01:44:17.125
Okay, now to settle things once and for...

01:44:18.293 --> 01:44:19.753
No, I'm not giving up!

01:44:19.961 --> 01:44:22.046
I've got pride, too!

01:44:24.466 --> 01:44:25.717
| wasn't in time.

01:44:25.925 --> 01:44:27.802
They got in.

01:44:28.011 --> 01:44:30.138
If we get them into a hand-to-hand fight,
we have a chance to win!

01:44:30.346 --> 01:44:33.641
Cut power and communications,
then rescue the hostages!

01:44:33.850 --> 01:44:35.643
Zun ming!

01:44:35.852 --> 01:44:37.604
Holding out this long was good enough.

01:44:37.812 --> 01:44:39.939
Land the ship in the Pacific.

01:44:40.148 --> 01:44:42.358
You all will now follow mission Apate Aletheia.

01:44:42.567 --> 01:44:44.778
Master Lelouch...

01:44:44.986 --> 01:44:47.363
You have served me well.

01:44:47.572 --> 01:44:50.950
| am grateful for the
resolution you all have shown.

01:44:51.159 --> 01:44:53.369
Yes, Your Majesty.

01:44:54.704 --> 01:44:56.748
Should we fire the F.L.E.I.J.A. here?

01:44:56.956 --> 01:44:59.751
We still have the blaze luminous.
We should wait for criticality.

01:44:59.959 --> 01:45:04.214
Good point. It's a good chance
to eliminate the Black Knights, though.

01:45:04.422 --> 01:45:07.634
No, I suppose I shouldn't.
We mustn't be greedy.

01:45:07.842 --> 01:45:13.014
Yes, I understand. This is a
personal request from me. However...

01:45:13.223 --> 01:45:16.059
It was also Princess Euphemia's wish, wasn't it?

01:45:16.267 --> 01:45:18.561
Which is why... I have to do it.

01:45:18.770 --> 01:45:22.190
However, unless the environmental data
is entered into the final program,

01:45:22.398 --> 01:45:24.943
the device won't be complete.
Let me go with you.

01:45:25.151 --> 01:45:26.653
You've done enough, Nina.

01:45:26.861 --> 01:45:28.571
Though we may have been
on the student council together,

01:45:28.780 --> 01:45:32.283
| admire how you've stuck with me,
Zero, the man who killed Euphy,

01:45:32.492 --> 01:45:36.454
the first person to acknowledge you.

01:45:36.663 --> 01:45:39.833
| can't forgive Zero.

01:45:40.041 --> 01:45:42.335
Maybe not for the rest of my life.

01:45:42.544 --> 01:45:43.503
But...

01:45:43.711 --> 01:45:48.091
...this is separate from that.
| just had to find my own answer to all this.

01:45:48.299 --> 01:45:50.468
That's all.

01:45:53.012 --> 01:45:55.515
You really are amazing.

01:45:58.309 --> 01:46:00.603
C.C., you're all right?

01:46:00.812 --> 01:46:03.773
Well, that's a switch.
Were you worried about me?

01:46:03.982 --> 01:46:06.484
As a valued combatant.

01:46:06.693 --> 01:46:08.736
That's why I came to get this.

01:46:08.945 --> 01:46:10.697
Then you'll escort me?

01:46:10.905 --> 01:46:12.240
You're going out there, right?

01:46:12.448 --> 01:46:15.869
Even though you may have
to kill Nunnally yourself?

01:46:16.077 --> 01:46:19.622
If she stands in the way of the
Zero Requiem, I have no choice.

01:46:19.831 --> 01:46:23.251
Lelouch... Don't you hate me?

01:46:23.459 --> 01:46:27.964
| changed your fate drastically
by giving you Geass.

01:46:28.172 --> 01:46:31.134
This isn't what a witch
is supposed to say, is it?

01:46:32.677 --> 01:46:35.722
C.C., the Geass you gave me...

01:46:35.930 --> 01:46:39.642
What you gave me only
started me down the road.

01:46:39.851 --> 01:46:43.146
Everything that followed was my doing.

01:46:43.354 --> 01:46:46.316
I've never met a man like you.

01:46:46.524 --> 01:46:47.775
<i>CC...</i>

01:46:50.528 --> 01:46:51.654
Kallen!

01:46:51.863 --> 01:46:53.531
I'm going to stop you!

01:46:53.740 --> 01:46:55.783
Goodbye, Lelouch!

01:47:01.956 --> 01:47:04.042
Leave this to me! Get to Damocles!

01:47:04.250 --> 01:47:05.168
You stubborn...!

01:47:05.376 --> 01:47:07.128
But you're no match for the Guren!

01:47:07.337 --> 01:47:09.797
I'm glad that you care.

01:47:14.093 --> 01:47:15.678
| have to succeed.

01:47:15.678 --> 01:47:15.970
The pieces of a mosaic
| have to succeed.

01:47:15.970 --> 01:47:16.179
The pieces of a mosaic

01:47:16.179 --> 01:47:17.388
The pieces of a mosaic
This move has to work, no matter what!

01:47:17.388 --> 01:47:17.597
This move has to work, no matter what!

01:47:17.597 --> 01:47:18.473
Coming together one by one
This move has to work, no matter what!

01:47:18.473 --> 01:47:20.141
Coming together one by one

01:47:20.141 --> 01:47:21.267
Coming together one by one
Enemy Knightmares, approaching.

01:47:21.267 --> 01:47:21.476
Enemy Knightmares, approaching.

01:47:21.476 --> 01:47:21.935
To form the picture
Enemy Knightmares, approaching.

01:47:21.935 --> 01:47:22.143
To form the picture

01:47:22.143 --> 01:47:22.852
To form the picture
The Shinkiro is leading them.

01:47:22.852 --> 01:47:23.061
The Shinkiro is leading them.

01:47:23.061 --> 01:47:23.436
The meetings and partings I've had with you
The Shinkiro is leading them.

01:47:23.436 --> 01:47:23.645
The meetings and partings I've had with you

01:47:23.645 --> 01:47:26.814
The meetings and partings I've had with you Lower the
blaze luminous from over the F.L.E.I.J.A. launch tube.

01:47:26.814 --> 01:47:27.023
The meetings and partings I've had with you

01:47:27.023 --> 01:47:29.943
The meetings and partings I've had with you
Target the Shinkiro!

01:47:29.943 --> 01:47:30.151
The meetings and partings I've had with you

01:47:30.151 --> 01:47:31.235
The meetings and partings I've had with you Lelouch,
are you throwing your life away at the very end?

01:47:31.235 --> 01:47:32.612
Lelouch, are you throwing
your life away at the very end?

01:47:32.820 --> 01:47:33.905
How unsightly.

