and the others were doing?!

02:09:20.126 --> 02:09:22.921
Cease fire! I'll take care of him!

02:09:33.765 --> 02:09:35.558
Fool!

02:09:47.195 --> 02:09:52.242
As planned, the world's hatred
is focused on me.

02:09:52.450 --> 02:09:58.832
All that remains is to get rid of me
and break the chain of hatred.

02:09:59.040 --> 02:10:02.752
The legend of Zero
lives on in the Black Knights.

02:10:02.961 --> 02:10:05.130
Schneizel will serve Zero, too.

02:10:05.338 --> 02:10:07.590
With this, the world will be able
to gather not through force of arms,

02:10:07.799 --> 02:10:11.303
but around one table for discussion.

02:10:11.511 --> 02:10:13.763
They can move forward into the future.

02:10:19.644 --> 02:10:20.520
And that...

02:10:20.729 --> 02:10:22.314
Yes.

02:10:22.522 --> 02:10:24.941
...is the Zero Requiem.

02:10:27.444 --> 02:10:33.575
We both knew it back in Cs' World.
How people were longing for the future.

02:10:33.783 --> 02:10:39.039
Say, Suzaku... Geass is like a wish, isn't it?

02:10:44.753 --> 02:10:47.505
It's a request to someone
to give you the power to achieve

02:10:47.714 --> 02:10:49.257
what you can't on your own.

02:10:49.466 --> 02:10:51.092
A wish, huh?

02:10:51.301 --> 02:10:56.139
Yes. I'm going to cast the
Geass called a wish on people.

02:10:56.348 --> 02:10:58.308
For the future of the world.

02:11:03.938 --> 02:11:04.898
Lelouch...

02:11:05.106 --> 02:11:09.319
The price of the Geass
you're going to cast on them is...!

02:11:11.154 --> 02:11:15.116
The only people who should kill
are those prepared to die themselves!

02:11:21.623 --> 02:11:25.043
Suzaku... You're going to be a hero now.

02:11:25.251 --> 02:11:28.088
As the messiah who saved the world
from Emperor Lelouch vi Britannia,

02:11:28.296 --> 02:11:31.174
the enemy of the world.

02:11:31.383 --> 02:11:33.093
As Zero.

02:11:43.103 --> 02:11:45.563
L... Lelouch!

02:11:45.772 --> 02:11:51.152
This, then, shall be your punishment.

02:11:51.361 --> 02:11:58.159
You will live on, wearing that mask,
as the knight of justice.

02:11:58.368 --> 02:12:04.290
You will no longer live as Suzaku Kururugi.

02:12:04.499 --> 02:12:09.421
You shall sacrifice your own
ordinary pleasure to the world...

02:12:09.629 --> 02:12:10.839
...for evermore...

02:12:11.047 --> 02:12:15.135
This Geass... I do accept.

02:12:34.320 --> 02:12:36.573
Big brother?

02:12:43.163 --> 02:12:50.128
No... Everything you did until now was...

02:12:50.336 --> 02:12:52.881
Big brother, I love you!

02:12:54.591 --> 02:12:56.468
Yes...

02:12:56.676 --> 02:12:57.969
I---

02:13:01.556 --> 02:13:05.101
| destroy... the world...

02:13:08.271 --> 02:13:10.899
...and create it...

02:13:11.107 --> 02:13:13.359
...anew...

02:13:15.028 --> 02:13:15.987
Big brother!

02:13:16.196 --> 02:13:21.242
No! Please, open your eyes!
Big brother! Big brother!

02:13:22.869 --> 02:13:24.704
