02:13:24.913 --> 02:13:27.081
Free the prisoners!

02:13:27.290 --> 02:13:29.292
Leave it to Zero!

02:13:32.212 --> 02:13:35.131
Uh-oh. Retreat! Retreat, at once!

02:13:36.841 --> 02:13:38.593
Is it possible? Is that...?

02:13:38.801 --> 02:13:40.220
It's Zero!

02:13:40.428 --> 02:13:42.764
That's... That's Zero there!

02:13:42.972 --> 02:13:48.353
It's not fair... All I needed
to be happy was to be with you!

02:13:48.561 --> 02:13:52.899
How can I face the future without you?

02:14:05.870 --> 02:14:14.003
