02:14:28.226 --> 02:14:31.104
Well, Lelouch,

02:14:31.312 --> 02:14:34.732
the world's gotten a lot better since that day.

02:14:34.941 --> 02:14:37.235
All the energy once directed towards war

02:14:37.443 --> 02:14:41.656
has now been turned
toward poverty and education.

02:14:41.864 --> 02:14:45.326
Most of the hatreds and
evil deeds that stood in our way

02:14:45.535 --> 02:14:49.372
have been laid at your feet.

02:14:49.581 --> 02:14:55.128
It's all being chalked up as
the villainous Emperor Lelouch's doing.

02:14:55.336 --> 02:14:57.839
We're so quick to simplify our past troubles.

02:14:58.047 --> 02:15:03.052
But still, perhaps because of that,
people are free of the past

02:15:03.261 --> 02:15:05.680
and able to move forward into the future now.

02:15:07.849 --> 02:15:11.060
Hey, Lulu, society--

02:15:11.269 --> 02:15:15.273
The whole world still has
a lot of problems remaining,

02:15:15.481 --> 02:15:18.943
but even so, we're on track
to make great changes.

02:15:19.152 --> 02:15:23.865
If it were possible,
| wish you could see this world, too, Lulu.

02:15:24.073 --> 02:15:29.370
Well? Did everything go
according to your plan? Or instead...

02:15:40.757 --> 02:15:42.967
Wanting to overcome, just wanting to change,

02:15:43.176 --> 02:15:46.387
even pushing yourself up against the wall,

02:15:46.596 --> 02:15:48.890
unable to be honest anymore,

02:15:49.098 --> 02:15:54.312
did you burn or let yourself just fade away?

02:15:55.188 --> 02:16:00.151
Did you burn or let yourself just fade away?

02:16:01.110 --> 02:16:06.699
Is it better just to burn than fade away?

02:16:15.958 --> 02:16:18.670
Some live the dream to die for this moment

02:16:18.878 --> 02:16:21.714
Some wait for signs for heavens to open

02:16:21.923 --> 02:16:24.550
It's not pretending who you are

02:16:24.759 --> 02:16:27.553
if we are the proof of what we've done

02:16:27.762 --> 02:16:29.180
To do what is right

02:16:29.389 --> 02:16:30.473
or do what you're told

02:16:30.682 --> 02:16:33.601
They're both the same,
can't make everyone happy

02:16:33.810 --> 02:16:36.562
It's not pretending who you are

02:16:36.771 --> 02:16:41.818
if we are the proof of what we've done

02:16:46.698 --> 02:16:48.908
Wanting to overcome, just wanting to change,

02:16:49.117 --> 02:16:52.453
even pushing yourself up against the wall,

02:16:52.662 --> 02:16:54.914
unable to be honest anymore

02:16:55.123 --> 02:17:00.878
did you burn or let yourself just fade away?

02:17:01.087 --> 02:17:06.884
Did you burn or let yourself just fade away?

02:17:07.093 --> 02:17:12.557
Is it better just to burn than fade away?

02:17:21.899 --> 02:17:24.694
If I lived my dream to die for this moment

02:17:24.902 --> 02:17:27.655
would I choose the same,
in spite of what the world says?

02:17:27.864 --> 02:17:30.658
It's not pretending who you are

02:17:30.867 --> 02:17:33.745
if we are the proof of what we've done

02:17:33.953 --> 02:17:35.037
What makes it right?

02:17:35.246 --> 02:17:36.581
